<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:03.200" end="00:00:08.800" style="s2">Ava Morgan, 5 years old. Today, I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.100" end="00:00:10.700" style="s2">picking dad&#39;s wife, my new mom. Please</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.800" end="00:00:12.600" style="s2">don&#39;t let me pick an evil stepmother</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.700" end="00:00:14.200" style="s2">like the Queen in Snow Bud.</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.600" end="00:00:16.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, Mr. Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.200" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">Just like we agreed, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.200" end="00:00:20.300" style="s2">Whoever you choose, I&#39;ll marry her.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.500" end="00:00:24.600" style="s2">But do you have to look like a beggar</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.800" end="00:00:26.500" style="s2">who just climbed out of a dumpster?</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.600" end="00:00:29.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, dad. When you&#39;re broke, you find</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.500" end="00:00:29.700" style="s2">out who really cares.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.600" end="00:00:36.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, kiddo. That beggar costume is so</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.800" end="00:00:38.000" style="s2">realistic. Want to come to a Halloween</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.100" end="00:00:40.500" style="s2">party with me tonight?</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.000" end="00:00:42.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have any money. Can you take me</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.500" end="00:00:46.800" style="s2">to the party?</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.500" end="00:00:46.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, you&#39;re actually a little beggar?</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.400" end="00:00:54.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetie, I&#39;ve always wanted a baby.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.900" end="00:00:55.500" style="s2">Will you be my baby?</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.500" end="00:00:58.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.500" end="00:01:01.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can call me mommy, carry my purse,</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.900" end="00:01:04.800" style="s2">take my pictures, and tell me I&#39;m pretty</p>
<p begin="00:01:01.700" end="00:01:04.800" style="s2">every day.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.900" end="00:01:08.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey bro, I&#39;m busy here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.775" end="00:01:12.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.600" end="00:01:13.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like diamonds, yachts, a luxury estate</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.000" end="00:01:13.700" style="s2">far from downtown, and I&#39;ll need a</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.300" end="00:01:15.000" style="s2">driver.</p>
<p begin="00:01:13.700" end="00:01:15.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma&#39;am, those things are way beyond a</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.000" end="00:01:17.200" style="s2">5-year-old&#39;s allowance.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.900" end="00:01:19.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, does your dad have a yacht?</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.200" end="00:01:19.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ugh.</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.700" end="00:01:25.100" style="s2">Why are they all evil queens?</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.600" end="00:01:28.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh crap.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.300" end="00:01:42.100" style="s2">Who the hell put a fire HYDRANT HERE?</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.900" end="00:01:44.600" style="s2">WHAT, DOES THIS THING OWN THE WHOLE</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.100" end="00:01:44.600" style="s2">STREET?</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.800" end="00:01:50.000" style="s2">YEAH, I am on a blind date. 5 minutes</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.100" end="00:01:52.200" style="s2">tops, then I&#39;ll haul your load. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.000" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">worry.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.200" end="00:01:55.900" style="s2">All right, we&#39;re both busy. Let&#39;s do</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.600" end="00:01:57.800" style="s2">introductions. I&#39;m Claire Doyle. I drive</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.900" end="00:01:58.800" style="s2">a truck. Hey kiddo,</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.800" end="00:02:00.192" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.800" end="00:02:03.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Ava</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.192" end="00:02:06.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m on the state for my dad.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.692" end="00:02:08.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is his face on an FBI wanted poster?</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.392" end="00:02:10.292" style="s2">Sending a kid as his stand in?</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.792" end="00:02:13.892" style="s2">Good god, look at you. You look like a</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.292" end="00:02:13.892" style="s2">bear cub that&#39;s been rolling in mud.</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.892" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">Oh my god, your shoes have holes. Your</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.492" end="00:02:20.892" style="s2">toes are sticking out. I&#39;ve never seen</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.292" end="00:02:23.392" style="s2">such a careless dad.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.892" end="00:02:26.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 28 evil queens.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.392" end="00:02:27.592" style="s2">Not one of them wanted to be my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.292" end="00:02:30.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.592" end="00:02:30.092" style="s2">try these.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.651" end="00:02:33.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.892" end="00:02:34.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve never had new shoes before.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.092" end="00:02:36.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bought them for my daughter. 60 bucks,</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.692" end="00:02:37.992" style="s2">wrong size. Missed the return window, so</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.692" end="00:02:39.392" style="s2">they&#39;ve just been sitting in the trunk.</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.992" end="00:02:42.592" style="s2">Try them. What, you want me to pick you</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.392" end="00:02:42.592" style="s2">up and put them on? Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.892" end="00:02:55.192" style="s2">Hey, look at that. Just like Cinderella.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.492" end="00:02:59.092" style="s2">How do they feel?</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.292" end="00:03:04.992" style="s2">What, got something on my face?</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.192" end="00:03:05.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mom used to take care of me like</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.992" end="00:03:09.492" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.992" end="00:03:11.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your parents divorced? Who dumped who?</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.492" end="00:03:13.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She died.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.392" end="00:03:15.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.892" end="00:03:18.492" style="s2">Tell you what, let&#39;s get you some orange</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.492" end="00:03:18.492" style="s2">juice. My treat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.392" end="00:03:27.637" style="s2">318 bucks for orange juice?</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.592" end="00:03:29.592" style="s2">What&#39;s in it, premium crude oil?</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.637" end="00:03:31.092" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.592" end="00:03:33.192" style="s2">Come on, kiddo. I know a place that</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.092" end="00:03:34.292" style="s2">won&#39;t rob us.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.192" end="00:03:36.592" style="s2">Good, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.292" end="00:03:36.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.292" end="00:03:45.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, WATCH WHERE YOU&#39;RE DRIVING.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.692" end="00:03:45.392" style="s2">YOU ALMOST DRENCHED THIS KID,</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.792" end="00:03:50.192" style="s2">COME ON, BABY.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.292" end="00:03:54.492" style="s2">Slow down. This isn&#39;t A RACE</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.092" end="00:03:54.492" style="s2">TRACK.</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.192" end="00:03:58.892" style="s2">HEY,</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.192" end="00:04:02.492" style="s2">what&#39;s wrong? You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.892" end="00:04:03.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, will you be my mom?</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.492" end="00:04:05.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kid, you can&#39;t just pick</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.894" end="00:04:07.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; up a mom off the street. I don&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:04:05.294" end="00:04:09.794" style="s2">know what your dad looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.294" end="00:04:12.294" style="s2">What if he&#39;s a creep, a drunk, or some</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.794" end="00:04:15.194" style="s2"> who hits people?</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.294" end="00:04:18.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy, I&#39;ll take you to him right now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.194" end="00:04:20.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, wait, I&#39;ve got a delivery.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.194" end="00:04:22.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Add $2 billion to the Texas data center</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.194" end="00:04:23.094" style="s2">project. Crews break ground on phase one</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.194" end="00:04:25.894" style="s2">first thing Tuesday.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.094" end="00:04:25.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.894" end="00:04:28.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.794" end="00:04:29.894" style="s2">Miss April has found herself a</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.894" end="00:04:31.794" style="s2">stepmother.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.894" end="00:04:34.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re here already.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.794" end="00:04:34.794" style="s2">Come on, downstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.194" end="00:04:42.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.794" end="00:04:42.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your dad</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.094" end="00:04:52.294" style="s2">works here?</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.294" end="00:04:54.294" style="s2">Then why does he dress you like a</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.294" end="00:04:55.994" style="s2">beggar? Wait, is he a janitor,</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.294" end="00:04:59.894" style="s2">maintenance, or a bodyguard?</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.994" end="00:04:59.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, my dad&#39;s Gray Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.794" end="00:05:06.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay alert. Keep Mr. Morgan&#39;s real</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.694" end="00:05:07.994" style="s2">identity under wraps.</p>
<p begin="00:05:06.694" end="00:05:09.594" style="s2">Why is the boss dressed like that for a</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.994" end="00:05:12.594" style="s2">date?</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.594" end="00:05:15.994" style="s2">Too much reality TV.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.594" end="00:05:15.994" style="s2">It&#39;s a test. Keep your head down.</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.294" end="00:05:25.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, why are you wearing that?</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.894" end="00:05:27.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart, I was hanging outside the</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.694" end="00:05:30.778" style="s2">55th floor washing windows today. This</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.694" end="00:05:30.894" style="s2">is my custom Spider-Man suit.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.778" end="00:05:33.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.894" end="00:05:35.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, this is my new mom.</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.794" end="00:05:38.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice outfit.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.194" end="00:05:38.194" style="s2">Janitor on the side, too?</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.694" end="00:05:42.394" style="s2">And don&#39;t go calling me mom just yet,</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.094" end="00:05:44.694" style="s2">kid. You might be easy, but I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.394" end="00:05:46.894" style="s2">standards.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.694" end="00:05:49.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 28 interviews, and this is who she</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.894" end="00:05:51.494" style="s2">brings home? All right,</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.094" end="00:05:53.994" style="s2">let&#39;s see what she&#39;s really like.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.494" end="00:05:56.494" style="s2">Shall we sit somewhere, get a drink?</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.994" end="00:05:56.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lead the way.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.494" end="00:06:07.395" style="s2">Amazing. You said drinks. I figured</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.594" end="00:06:08.695" style="s2">coffee at least. Instead, you parked me</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.395" end="00:06:09.795" style="s2">outside a fancy restaurant and hand me</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.695" end="00:06:12.195" style="s2">bottled water?</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.795" end="00:06:13.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is. Not good enough for her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.195" end="00:06:14.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, bottled water isn&#39;t good enough?</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.395" end="00:06:17.995" style="s2">Tell you what, I got a bonus today. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.795" end="00:06:19.995" style="s2">buy us some Cokes. Let&#39;s splurge.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.995" end="00:06:22.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; down. Don&#39;t waste your money. Water&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.995" end="00:06:22.295" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.295" end="00:06:26.195" style="s2">You&#39;re so cheap. I&#39;m scared this date</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.995" end="00:06:27.109" style="s2">will tank and you&#39;ll make me split the</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.195" end="00:06:28.795" style="s2">Coke bill.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.109" end="00:06:30.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:06:28.795" end="00:06:32.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, she just told you not to spend</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.195" end="00:06:32.795" style="s2">money on her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.295" end="00:06:35.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a first.</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.895" end="00:06:44.295" style="s2">Let me introduce myself properly.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.095" end="00:06:46.395" style="s2">I&#39;m Gray Moore.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.295" end="00:06:49.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.395" end="00:06:49.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Morgan Group&#39;s window cleaner.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.895" end="00:06:54.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray the window cleaner, got it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.495" end="00:06:56.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, Daddy owns the whole building.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.495" end="00:06:58.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, your dad&#39;s quite something, kiddo.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.895" end="00:07:00.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She means I clean every window in the</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.495" end="00:07:01.695" style="s2">building. You know, all 55 floors, top</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.695" end="00:07:04.295" style="s2">to bottom.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.695" end="00:07:05.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, Mr. Spider-Man.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.295" end="00:07:06.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since we&#39;re getting along, would you</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.395" end="00:07:08.595" style="s2">like to come over?</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.395" end="00:07:08.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.695" end="00:07:13.595" style="s2"> left my phone on that bench.</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.895" end="00:07:13.595" style="s2">Be right back.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.095" end="00:07:18.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dean, buy me a place right now.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.495" end="00:07:19.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A waterfront penthouse, sir, or a</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.995" end="00:07:22.095" style="s2">townhouse?</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.795" end="00:07:22.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.695" end="00:07:26.295" style="s2">Somewhere around here.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.195" end="00:07:28.295" style="s2">The oldest, smallest, most run-down</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.295" end="00:07:30.195" style="s2">apartment you can find.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.295" end="00:07:32.695" style="s2">The worse, the better.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.195" end="00:07:35.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.695" end="00:07:37.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. Get the keys immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.395" end="00:07:42.695" style="s2">Understood, right away.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.895" end="00:07:43.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy, don&#39;t we have lots of big houses?</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.695" end="00:07:46.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sweetheart,</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.895" end="00:07:46.495" style="s2">it&#39;s a secret.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.605" end="00:07:54.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.695" end="00:07:55.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good God, when did anyone last clean</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.095" end="00:07:56.995" style="s2">this place?</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.795" end="00:07:58.195" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.995" end="00:08:00.595" style="s2">You live here?</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.195" end="00:08:00.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.495" end="00:08:10.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I barely touched it.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.195" end="00:08:10.697" style="s2">How your table just fall apart?</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.600" end="00:08:12.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.697" end="00:08:15.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.097" end="00:08:15.097" style="s2">it&#39;s been around a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.997" end="00:08:20.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is this coat full of holes?</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.897" end="00:08:21.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s just a little old, still wearable.</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.425" end="00:08:24.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.297" end="00:08:24.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is how you live?</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.497" end="00:08:26.997" style="s2">Let&#39;s talk outside.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.997" end="00:08:29.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guess she&#39;s no different from the</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.997" end="00:08:29.297" style="s2">others.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.997" end="00:08:34.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All that dust is bad for a kid. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.897" end="00:08:34.397" style="s2">talk out here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.097" end="00:08:38.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avett&#39;s mother passed away a long time</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.697" end="00:08:40.897" style="s2">ago. It&#39;s just been the two of us ever</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.297" end="00:08:44.297" style="s2">since. I work 12 hours a day,</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.897" end="00:08:44.297" style="s2">make about $2,000 a month.</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.897" end="00:08:47.997" style="s2">So,</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.897" end="00:08:49.897" style="s2">could you see the three of us being a</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.997" end="00:08:52.097" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.897" end="00:08:54.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2,000 a month in this city and you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.097" end="00:08:56.397" style="s2">got the nerve to talk marriage?</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.397" end="00:08:57.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Knew it. Tell them what I earn and the</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.397" end="00:08:59.297" style="s2">real ones sort themselves out from the</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.897" end="00:09:00.297" style="s2">gold diggers.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.297" end="00:09:03.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.297" end="00:09:03.197" style="s2">Are you even listening?</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.097" end="00:09:08.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly are you saying?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.397" end="00:09:11.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not even trying.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.897" end="00:09:13.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.997" end="00:09:15.097" style="s2">What did she just say?</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.197" end="00:09:16.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t even finish high school. I</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.097" end="00:09:18.597" style="s2">drive a truck built like a tank and pull</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.997" end="00:09:20.897" style="s2">in 8 grand a month.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.597" end="00:09:22.597" style="s2">My kid deserves a decent life.</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.897" end="00:09:24.497" style="s2">You know what really pisses me off? Not</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.597" end="00:09:26.397" style="s2">what you earn. It&#39;s that half-assed</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.497" end="00:09:27.697" style="s2">attitude.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.397" end="00:09:28.797" style="s2">We can work ourselves tired. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.697" end="00:09:29.997" style="s2">fine.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.797" end="00:09:30.997" style="s2">But why should our kids have to suffer</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.997" end="00:09:32.497" style="s2">with us?</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.997" end="00:09:33.997" style="s2">Look at her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.497" end="00:09:35.897" style="s2">You let your daughter go out in rags</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.997" end="00:09:37.097" style="s2">looking homeless. The only decent thing</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.897" end="00:09:38.097" style="s2">she&#39;s wearing is the pair of sneakers I</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.097" end="00:09:39.797" style="s2">bought her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.097" end="00:09:42.097" style="s2">You&#39;ve got your pride. She&#39;s got hers,</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.797" end="00:09:43.997" style="s2">too. What kind of father are you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.097" end="00:09:45.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you&#39;re done, boss. She&#39;s skinning</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.997" end="00:09:47.197" style="s2">you alive.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.397" end="00:09:50.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn, she&#39;s tearing that guy a new one.</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.197" end="00:09:50.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re not married. Get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:09:54.097" end="00:09:58.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy,</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.197" end="00:09:58.097" style="s2">does she hate me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.097" end="00:10:03.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Maybe I took the act too far.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.597" end="00:10:07.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.897" end="00:10:07.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you two getting in or what?</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.397" end="00:10:14.098" style="s2">Talk to the supervisor. Unload all this,</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.198" end="00:10:15.498" style="s2">you get 500 bucks.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.098" end="00:10:18.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All by myself?</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.498" end="00:10:21.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s only 500 pounds. Quit whining. Earn</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.198" end="00:10:21.498" style="s2">some money and buy your kid clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.198" end="00:10:25.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re cut for the run, Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.998" end="00:10:29.198" style="s2">Not going to count it?</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.698" end="00:10:29.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need, Ray. I trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.098" end="00:10:33.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously, where&#39;d you find this guy?</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.198" end="00:10:35.798" style="s2">Looks like he&#39;s never worked a day of</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.498" end="00:10:38.498" style="s2">manual labor. Whole afternoon barely</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.798" end="00:10:39.998" style="s2">moved a few boxes. Dead weight. Marry a</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.498" end="00:10:41.798" style="s2">guy who can&#39;t even lift a crate, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.998" end="00:10:43.398" style="s2">in for a miserable life. Should have let</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.798" end="00:10:44.598" style="s2">me set you up with that guy down at the</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.398" end="00:10:47.147" style="s2">docks.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.598" end="00:10:49.167" style="s2">Easy 800 a day.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.147" end="00:10:49.167" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.498" end="00:10:51.798" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.298" end="00:10:59.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t even hold a box. You call yourself</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.398" end="00:11:02.298" style="s2">a man?</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.498" end="00:11:04.398" style="s2">No diploma, no muscle, no skills. What</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.298" end="00:11:05.898" style="s2">exactly are you good for?</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.398" end="00:11:08.998" style="s2">You expect your wife</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.898" end="00:11:08.998" style="s2">to struggle like this forever?</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.098" end="00:11:11.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You speak to me like that. Do you know</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.698" end="00:11:13.798" style="s2">who I am?</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.798" end="00:11:15.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down. Catch your breath. I&#39;ll do the</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.798" end="00:11:19.898" style="s2">heavy lifting.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.998" end="00:11:19.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re moving all this yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.398" end="00:11:23.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else? Wait for you? You&#39;d be here</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.898" end="00:11:24.798" style="s2">till Christmas.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.198" end="00:11:26.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A man should do the heavy lifting.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.798" end="00:11:28.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? A Y Chromosome doesn&#39;t make you</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.298" end="00:11:29.698" style="s2">a forklift. You think women just sit</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.098" end="00:11:31.398" style="s2">around waiting for men to lift things</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.698" end="00:11:33.698" style="s2">and pay the bills?</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.398" end="00:11:36.098" style="s2">News flash. Anything you can lift, I can</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.698" end="00:11:36.098" style="s2">lift too.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.498" end="00:11:41.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing like any woman I&#39;ve ever met.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.498" end="00:11:41.898" style="s2">Let me help.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.898" end="00:11:47.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what happened? Let me see.</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.898" end="00:11:49.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. Just a scratch.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.898" end="00:11:52.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, don&#39;t do that. You want it infected?</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.798" end="00:11:52.298" style="s2">Hold still.</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.298" end="00:11:57.498" style="s2">Rinse it off first next time. Take care</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.098" end="00:11:59.498" style="s2">of yourself, all right?</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.498" end="00:12:00.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, why is your face so red?</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.498" end="00:12:01.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s not.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.598" end="00:12:04.598" style="s2">It&#39;s hot in here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.698" end="00:12:04.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want me to fan you?</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.798" end="00:12:08.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at you three. Picture perfect</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.698" end="00:12:09.498" style="s2">little family.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.098" end="00:12:10.498" style="s2">Nice work today, buddy. Here&#39;s your</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.498" end="00:12:11.598" style="s2">share.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.498" end="00:12:12.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take that.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.598" end="00:12:14.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is. After</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.799" end="00:12:15.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; my wages all along. Should have known</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.699" end="00:12:16.799" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.699" end="00:12:18.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Got a problem?</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.799" end="00:12:20.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No problem. Keep it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.499" end="00:12:20.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. From now on, I handle our family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.599" end="00:12:22.099" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.999" end="00:12:23.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.099" end="00:12:24.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say? Our family?</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.299" end="00:12:26.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Ray&#39;s paying me a referral bonus</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.699" end="00:12:27.399" style="s2">for every long-term hire? Act like we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.099" end="00:12:29.099" style="s2">a family, he&#39;ll figure you&#39;re stable.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.399" end="00:12:30.099" style="s2">Not going to quit after two days. What</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.099" end="00:12:32.199" style="s2">exactly [clears throat] do you mean?</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.099" end="00:12:35.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s it. Got ahead of myself.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.199" end="00:12:37.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, you&#39;re going to be my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:12:35.499" end="00:12:38.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re out here to make a living.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.099" end="00:12:40.499" style="s2">But hey, funny how we found each other.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.599" end="00:12:42.599" style="s2">Let&#39;s see where it goes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.499" end="00:12:44.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A first. A woman who&#39;s not after my</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.599" end="00:12:45.399" style="s2">wallet or my name.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.299" end="00:12:46.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, come over tonight. Meet my</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.399" end="00:12:48.699" style="s2">daughter. What do you say?</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.999" end="00:12:50.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll be there.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.699" end="00:12:51.599" style="s2">A little extra help with the family</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.199" end="00:12:53.299" style="s2">expenses.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.599" end="00:12:54.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I appreciate it. Thank you, Ray.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.299" end="00:12:55.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Ray.</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.299" end="00:12:57.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call it an early wedding present. See</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.799" end="00:13:00.399" style="s2">you around.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.899" end="00:13:00.399" style="s2">Take care.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.899" end="00:13:11.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s pretty great, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.699" end="00:13:11.099" style="s2">Hi.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.499" end="00:13:25.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey kiddo. [clears throat] Last minute</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.799" end="00:13:26.799" style="s2">gift. Didn&#39;t know what you liked.</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.499" end="00:13:29.299" style="s2">Figured I couldn&#39;t go wrong with Barbie.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.799" end="00:13:29.299" style="s2">Hope you like it.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.499" end="00:13:33.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already have this one.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.899" end="00:13:36.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.199" end="00:13:36.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay. You didn&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.399" end="00:13:42.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fair point. Rookie move. My mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.999" end="00:13:44.099" style="s2">Nothing like her mother.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.899" end="00:13:45.799" style="s2">I &#39;ll do better next time. Give me a</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.099" end="00:13:49.699" style="s2">hint. What do you like?</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.799" end="00:13:52.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Art stuff, markers, things like that.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.699" end="00:13:55.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Markers. Noted that I can manage.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.899" end="00:13:57.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interesting little girl.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.699" end="00:14:01.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll buy me anything I want?</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.699" end="00:14:01.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Just ask.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.799" end="00:14:09.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I want this. No taking it back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.499" end="00:14:10.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ultimate SAT mastery bundle?</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.499" end="00:14:13.299" style="s2">You that joking?</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.599" end="00:14:14.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. I&#39;d rather spend my time on</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.299" end="00:14:17.301" style="s2">something that&#39;ll actually help my</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.801" end="00:14:17.301" style="s2">future.</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.701" end="00:14:22.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maya, honey, we&#39;ve talked about this.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.501" end="00:14:24.501" style="s2">You&#39;re a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.701" end="00:14:26.101" style="s2">You&#39;re allowed to be a kid.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.501" end="00:14:27.401" style="s2">Have fun.</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.101" end="00:14:30.101" style="s2">You don&#39;t need your nose in a textbook</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.401" end="00:14:32.501" style="s2">every waking second.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.101" end="00:14:34.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I just want to work hard so I can</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.501" end="00:14:36.301" style="s2">buy you a big house one day.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.901" end="00:14:38.101" style="s2">Send you around the world with your</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.301" end="00:14:41.001" style="s2">friends.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.101" end="00:14:41.001" style="s2">That&#39;s all I think about.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.001" end="00:14:46.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh Maya, I thought you&#39;d grow up, get</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.101" end="00:14:48.301" style="s2">sick of me, and dump me in a nursing</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.701" end="00:14:50.101" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.301" end="00:14:52.501" style="s2">Honey, is it too late to hitch my wagon</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.101" end="00:14:52.501" style="s2">to you?</p>
<p begin="00:14:54.201" end="00:14:56.601" style="s2">Let me get you all something good to</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.401" end="00:14:57.501" style="s2">eat.</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.601" end="00:14:59.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll help.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.501" end="00:15:02.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re good, Mr. Morgan. Sit tight.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.901" end="00:15:05.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maya, let&#39;s play a game.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.401" end="00:15:05.001" style="s2">Trivia Night.</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.901" end="00:15:12.201" style="s2">Three rounds. Movies, pop culture, and</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.701" end="00:15:14.201" style="s2">general knowledge. One point per right</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.201" end="00:15:16.701" style="s2">answer. First to five win.</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.201" end="00:15:19.401" style="s2">Simple rules. No phones, no peeking, and</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.701" end="00:15:20.501" style="s2">no asking grown-ups for help.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.401" end="00:15:22.901" style="s2">Contestants, [clears throat] listen up.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.501" end="00:15:25.901" style="s2">Round one, lightning round. Question</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.901" end="00:15:28.201" style="s2">one. Which celebrity wore a dress made</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.901" end="00:15:31.601" style="s2">of raw meat on an awards show red</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.201" end="00:15:33.901" style="s2">carpet? 10 seconds, starting now.</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.601" end="00:15:36.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is what you call a game?</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.901" end="00:15:37.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, dinner&#39;s up. Bet you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.101" end="00:15:41.401" style="s2">starving.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.901" end="00:15:44.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, awesome.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.401" end="00:15:44.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here you go, Maya.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.101" end="00:15:48.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is. Her own daughter comes</p>
<p begin="00:15:47.101" end="00:15:51.901" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.201" end="00:15:51.901" style="s2">Should I really let them into our life?</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.101" end="00:15:58.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you, little bottomless pint, get</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.901" end="00:16:00.201" style="s2">too. You&#39;re still growing. Got to feed</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.001" end="00:16:01.550" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.201" end="00:16:02.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YES.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.550" end="00:16:05.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.501" end="00:16:07.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GOT THAT WRONG.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.201" end="00:16:10.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DIG IN. Last one done does the dishes.</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.901" end="00:16:12.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All these years, thought giving Averit</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.001" end="00:16:15.306" style="s2">the best of everything was enough. What</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.001" end="00:16:17.001" style="s2">she really needed was a home.</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.306" end="00:16:19.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.001" end="00:16:21.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I told you, I &#39;m not marrying that</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.002" end="00:16:23.602" style="s2">bald old bastard. I found someone. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.402" end="00:16:24.602" style="s2">bring him over tomorrow. Happy?</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.602" end="00:16:26.302" style="s2">You&#39;re coming to my parents place</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.602" end="00:16:27.002" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.302" end="00:16:28.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.002" end="00:16:29.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I just told them I found someone</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.302" end="00:16:30.502" style="s2">to marry.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.602" end="00:16:31.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.502" end="00:16:32.302" style="s2">Who?</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.402" end="00:16:35.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.302" end="00:16:36.602" style="s2">Starting tomorrow, you&#39;re my fiancé.</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.302" end="00:16:40.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you think to ask me?</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.602" end="00:16:40.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? You&#39;re the only one here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.302" end="00:16:43.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you taken care of everything I</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.502" end="00:16:45.702" style="s2">asked?</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.602" end="00:16:47.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $10 million wired. The deed to the</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.702" end="00:16:50.102" style="s2">Highlands penthouse is ready, and the $3</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.702" end="00:16:51.402" style="s2">million custom diamond is taken care of.</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.102" end="00:16:54.002" style="s2">Everything else is moving according to</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.402" end="00:16:54.002" style="s2">plan, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.102" end="00:16:56.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Enough work. Ready to pick up</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.002" end="00:16:59.602" style="s2">your new mom?</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.802" end="00:16:59.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.802" end="00:17:04.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $2,000 a month and a 5-year-old to feed,</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.302" end="00:17:05.902" style="s2">Claire? Have you lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.202" end="00:17:07.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, can you calm down? He&#39;s coming</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.902" end="00:17:09.102" style="s2">today. Meet the guy before you tear him</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.202" end="00:17:10.102" style="s2">apart, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.102" end="00:17:11.802" style="s2">Should be here any minute.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.102" end="00:17:13.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a chance. A bricklayer who can</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.802" end="00:17:16.202" style="s2">barely feed himself with a 5-year-old in</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.502" end="00:17:17.802" style="s2">tow marry my daughter in his dreams?</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.202" end="00:17:19.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least meet him first.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.802" end="00:17:21.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need to meet him.</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.402" end="00:17:22.502" style="s2">Two grand a month won&#39;t cover rent.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.002" end="00:17:25.302" style="s2">How&#39;s he going to support you? Pay the</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.502" end="00:17:25.302" style="s2">bills with love?</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.902" end="00:17:29.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, nobody&#39;s asking you to pay his</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.502" end="00:17:29.902" style="s2">bills.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.102" end="00:17:34.502" style="s2">Claire, you passed up a rich man like</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.802" end="00:17:37.502" style="s2">Dale for some broke guy? What are you</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.502" end="00:17:39.302" style="s2">thinking? Dale owns three coal mines,</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.502" end="00:17:41.502" style="s2">makes seven figures a year. You should</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.302" end="00:17:43.802" style="s2">be grateful he&#39;d even date you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:41.502" end="00:17:46.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you marry him.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.802" end="00:17:48.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, sis. Think about the family. If</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.502" end="00:17:51.302" style="s2">Dale was my brother-in-law,</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.202" end="00:17:53.302" style="s2">I&#39;d never have to worry about money.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.302" end="00:17:54.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cody, you&#39;re almost an adult.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.302" end="00:17:55.502" style="s2">How about figuring out how to support</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.602" end="00:17:57.702" style="s2">yourself?</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.502" end="00:17:59.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. We&#39;re looking out for you.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.702" end="00:18:01.402" style="s2">Raising Maya alone is hard enough. Now</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.802" end="00:18:04.502" style="s2">you want a man who makes two grand a</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.402" end="00:18:08.002" style="s2">month and comes with a 5-year-old?</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.502" end="00:18:08.002" style="s2">You think love pays a mortgage?</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.802" end="00:18:12.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hank, I drive my own truck, make 8,000 a</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.502" end="00:18:13.802" style="s2">month. Do I need you to find someone to</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.902" end="00:18:16.602" style="s2">pay my bills?</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.802" end="00:18:16.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your tone.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.002" end="00:18:21.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been helping pay this family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.102" end="00:18:23.703" style="s2">bills since I was 16. Cody&#39;s tuition,</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.503" end="00:18:24.903" style="s2">repairs on this house, who always paid?</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.703" end="00:18:26.803" style="s2">Me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.903" end="00:18:29.703" style="s2">Cody, who paid for your summer camp last</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.803" end="00:18:33.603" style="s2">year? That&#39;s right. Me again. So don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.703" end="00:18:34.703" style="s2">lecture me about sacrificing for family.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.603" end="00:18:36.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You tell him, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.703" end="00:18:38.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why do you think I wanted you to meet</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.003" end="00:18:39.103" style="s2">Dale? He could set you up for life.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.103" end="00:18:41.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.103" end="00:18:43.203" style="s2">You said that last time.</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.603" end="00:18:44.203" style="s2">Remember how you talked up my ex? How&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.203" end="00:18:46.803" style="s2">that go?</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.203" end="00:18:47.903" style="s2">Drunk all day, gambling away the rent.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.803" end="00:18:50.543" style="s2">Took me a year to get rid of that</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.903" end="00:18:51.903" style="s2"> This time, I picked my own man.</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.543" end="00:18:54.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.903" end="00:18:56.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Good luck. But when you&#39;re crammed</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.303" end="00:18:57.903" style="s2">into a trailer with that brick layer and</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.103" end="00:18:59.303" style="s2">can&#39;t afford gas, don&#39;t come knocking on</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.903" end="00:19:01.503" style="s2">my door.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.303" end="00:19:03.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bet he&#39;s crawling over here in some beat</p>
<p begin="00:19:01.503" end="00:19:07.003" style="s2">up old pickup right now.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.403" end="00:19:08.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably broke down halfway.</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.003" end="00:19:12.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You two are perfect for each other. Why</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.903" end="00:19:12.503" style="s2">not hook up and spare everybody else?</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.303" end="00:19:16.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care what piece of junk he</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.703" end="00:19:19.103" style="s2">drives. As long as I&#39;m here, he&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.703" end="00:19:20.903" style="s2">setting foot in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.103" end="00:19:23.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got this backwards.</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.903" end="00:19:24.503" style="s2">I&#39;m bringing him so you can meet him.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.203" end="00:19:26.503" style="s2">I&#39;m not asking permission.</p>
<p begin="00:19:24.503" end="00:19:29.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, don&#39;t forget I&#39;m your father.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.503" end="00:19:31.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stepfather. You&#39;re my stepfather, Hank.</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.003" end="00:19:32.803" style="s2">Your house, your rules. Who I marry,</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.903" end="00:19:35.503" style="s2">that&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.803" end="00:19:37.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hank, enough. She&#39;s an adult. Let her</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.503" end="00:19:38.703" style="s2">make her own decision.</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.103" end="00:19:41.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she brings that broke bastard here</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.703" end="00:19:41.203" style="s2">today, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.903" end="00:19:46.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s he doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.503" end="00:19:54.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dale, Mr. Sinclair, what an honor. What</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.103" end="00:19:56.403" style="s2">brings you here?</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.303" end="00:19:59.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, I&#39;m here at McCallum Imported</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.403" end="00:20:00.803" style="s2">Cuban Cigars today. Vintage McCallum</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.103" end="00:20:05.503" style="s2">Imported Cuban Cigars and the main</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.803" end="00:20:05.503" style="s2">event, a cashier&#39;s check for $880,000.</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.803" end="00:20:11.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back off. Nobody&#39;s selling me today.</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.103" end="00:20:13.903" style="s2">Want his money that bad? Divorce my</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.803" end="00:20:16.003" style="s2">brother and marry him yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.903" end="00:20:17.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, Dale, you&#39;re so generous.</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.003" end="00:20:18.503" style="s2">Claire would be crazy to turn down a</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.603" end="00:20:20.403" style="s2">catch like you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.503" end="00:20:22.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, Claire. Heard you&#39;re still</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.403" end="00:20:26.005" style="s2">driving that big rig. Why work like a</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.703" end="00:20:28.705" style="s2">man? me, stay home, lounge by the pool,</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.005" end="00:20:31.305" style="s2">sip mimosas, take it easy.</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.705" end="00:20:32.305" style="s2">The kid, I&#39;ll put her in a private prep</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.305" end="00:20:35.605" style="s2">school.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.305" end="00:20:37.105" style="s2">880,000 in tuition. I&#39;m offering you a</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.605" end="00:20:38.805" style="s2">way out.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.105" end="00:20:41.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t need your money.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.805" end="00:20:41.405" style="s2">Keep it.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.005" end="00:20:55.704" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dale, come back. We&#39;re not done talking.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.684" end="00:20:55.704" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.805" end="00:20:59.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, Dale,</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.105" end="00:21:01.805" style="s2">nice bank account, but shiny bald heads</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.905" end="00:21:02.905" style="s2">don&#39;t do it for me. Take your gifts and</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.805" end="00:21:04.905" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.905" end="00:21:06.705" style="s2">Besides, bad timing. The man I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.905" end="00:21:08.505" style="s2">actually marrying is coming today to put</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.705" end="00:21:10.505" style="s2">a ring on my finger himself.</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.505" end="00:21:11.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WOULD YOU SAY? CODY, WHAT THE HELL ARE</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.505" end="00:21:13.305" style="s2">YOU PLAYING AT?</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.305" end="00:21:13.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DALE, BUDDY, I&#39;m sorry. She&#39;s throwing a</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.305" end="00:21:15.605" style="s2">fit.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.905" end="00:21:17.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you crazy, Claire?</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.605" end="00:21:19.005" style="s2">This isn&#39;t up for discussion. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.105" end="00:21:20.405" style="s2">marrying Mr. Sinclair or I&#39;m cutting you</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.005" end="00:21:22.305" style="s2">off for good.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.405" end="00:21:24.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Mom and I don&#39;t need a bunch of</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.305" end="00:21:27.805" style="s2">greedy leeches. I&#39;ll get a scholarship</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.505" end="00:21:27.805" style="s2">and buy her a real house.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.105" end="00:21:32.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You little brat. I&#39;ll teach you some</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.805" end="00:21:36.405" style="s2">manners.</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.305" end="00:21:36.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. Let her decide for herself.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.505" end="00:21:44.405" style="s2">Last time, you sold her to a gambler for</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.105" end="00:21:47.305" style="s2">a payout.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.405" end="00:21:48.105" style="s2">You ruined her life once. I will not let</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.305" end="00:21:51.005" style="s2">you do it again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.105" end="00:21:51.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT YOUR MOUTH.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.405" end="00:21:59.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GRANDMA. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.305" end="00:22:03.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T TOUCH MY MOM.</p>
<p begin="00:21:59.105" end="00:22:05.905" style="s2">She stands up for me and you hit her?</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.305" end="00:22:08.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hank, I will never forgive you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.905" end="00:22:08.405" style="s2">Never.</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.975" end="00:22:13.905" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.905" end="00:22:18.605" style="s2">You like solving things WITH VIOLENCE?</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.905" end="00:22:20.605" style="s2">FINE. NOBODY&#39;S LEAVING THIS YARD TODAY.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.605" end="00:22:21.605" style="s2">ARE YOU OUT OF YOUR MIND? PUT THAT THING</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.605" end="00:22:23.105" style="s2">DOWN.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.605" end="00:22:25.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CLAIRE, I&#39;M BEGGING YOU. You&#39;re being</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.105" end="00:22:26.606" style="s2">completely unreasonable.</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.405" end="00:22:28.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You hit her and</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.606" end="00:22:32.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; now you want to talk reason?</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.706" end="00:22:34.206" style="s2">Get on your knees. Apologize to mom.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.306" end="00:22:37.006" style="s2">Or I swear</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.206" end="00:22:37.006" style="s2">this isn&#39;t over.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.806" end="00:22:52.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pointing that thing at me. Are</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.006" end="00:22:54.006" style="s2">you crazy?</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.706" end="00:22:56.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hank Doyle,</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.006" end="00:22:57.506" style="s2">my mom&#39;s put up with you for 30 years.</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.106" end="00:23:00.606" style="s2">She&#39;s had enough.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.506" end="00:23:02.006" style="s2">You owe her an apology.</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.606" end="00:23:04.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, enough.</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.006" end="00:23:04.706" style="s2">Put the sight down.</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.406" end="00:23:11.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, please put it down. Don&#39;t do</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.706" end="00:23:11.906" style="s2">this over me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.236" end="00:23:13.506" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.906" end="00:23:16.206" style="s2">Apologize</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.506" end="00:23:16.206" style="s2">to her face.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.026" end="00:23:25.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.206" end="00:23:29.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s got nothing left to lose.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.806" end="00:23:30.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, absolutely not. Marry a psycho like</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.106" end="00:23:32.806" style="s2">that, I might not wake up the next</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.406" end="00:23:35.406" style="s2">morning. Your family mess, you deal with</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.806" end="00:23:35.406" style="s2">it. I&#39;M OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.506" end="00:23:40.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DALE, WAIT.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.106" end="00:23:42.106" style="s2">HAVE YOU COMPLETELY lost it? Dale was</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.006" end="00:23:44.406" style="s2">this family&#39;s way out, and you blew it.</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.106" end="00:23:45.606" style="s2">What sane man would want you now? Enjoy</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.406" end="00:23:48.306" style="s2">dying alone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.606" end="00:23:48.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I WANT HER.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.506" end="00:24:00.416" style="s2">I want her.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.396" end="00:24:00.416" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.406" end="00:24:07.406" style="s2">I&#39;m here to take her home.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.006" end="00:24:13.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at that suit. Definitely bespoke.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.306" end="00:24:15.106" style="s2">Makes Dale&#39;s little fortune look like a</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.906" end="00:24:16.706" style="s2">joke.</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.106" end="00:24:18.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dress him up all you want.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.706" end="00:24:20.906" style="s2">Still a laborer.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.206" end="00:24:22.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. Probably rented that outfit. A</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.906" end="00:24:25.106" style="s2">real rich man wouldn&#39;t come to a dump</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.506" end="00:24:25.106" style="s2">like this.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.306" end="00:24:28.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, grandpa, grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:24:27.306" end="00:24:31.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sweetheart,</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.807" end="00:24:32.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; aren&#39;t you a charmer.</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.507" end="00:24:34.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold it, kid.</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.707" end="00:24:37.107" style="s2">I&#39;m not your grandpa.</p>
<p begin="00:24:34.607" end="00:24:40.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Cody? Aunt Jessa?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.107" end="00:24:40.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, hi.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.707" end="00:24:45.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avril, come here.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.408" end="00:24:45.507" style="s2">These people aren&#39;t very friendly.</p>
<p begin="00:24:47.307" end="00:24:50.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. and Mrs. Doyle,</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.107" end="00:24:51.408" style="s2">I&#39;m here to formally ask Claire to marry</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.507" end="00:24:53.207" style="s2">me. I&#39;ve prepared</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.408" end="00:24:54.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save the speech.</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.207" end="00:24:57.908" style="s2">You want my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.707" end="00:25:00.807" style="s2">You follow our rules.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.908" end="00:25:02.507" style="s2">Pay off my $100,000 mortgage.</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.807" end="00:25:04.607" style="s2">50 grand</p>
<p begin="00:25:02.507" end="00:25:06.908" style="s2">for Cody&#39;s new pickup.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.607" end="00:25:08.707" style="s2">150,000.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.908" end="00:25:10.107" style="s2">Not a penny less.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.707" end="00:25:11.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absurd.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.107" end="00:25:14.707" style="s2">8 million in cash in our trunk and these</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.807" end="00:25:16.007" style="s2">hillbillies are haggling over 150,000?</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.707" end="00:25:19.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.007" end="00:25:19.707" style="s2">150,000, that&#39;s all you&#39;re asking?</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.007" end="00:25:24.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, you&#39;re asking too much. A brick</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.207" end="00:25:26.107" style="s2">waiter can&#39;t cough up 150 grand. Dale&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.207" end="00:25:27.408" style="s2">gone. Scare this one off, we get</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.107" end="00:25:29.707" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.408" end="00:25:33.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;m in a good mood. Family</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.707" end="00:25:35.807" style="s2">discount, 100 grand, cash.</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.908" end="00:25:36.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Family discount? He&#39;s auctioning off his</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.807" end="00:25:39.267" style="s2">daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.908" end="00:25:40.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A divorcee with another man&#39;s kid, 100</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.267" end="00:25:42.807" style="s2">[clears throat] grand? She&#39;s not worth</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.507" end="00:25:42.807" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.107" end="00:25:48.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, these people are vultures. Are we</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.707" end="00:25:48.908" style="s2">really wasting our time here?</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.408" end="00:25:53.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m marrying Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.507" end="00:25:55.697" style="s2">We do this her way.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.607" end="00:25:55.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $150,000? [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.707" end="00:26:01.307" style="s2">Are you insane? She&#39;s your daughter, not</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.607" end="00:26:03.807" style="s2">something you can buy and sell.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.307" end="00:26:05.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I raised her for 20 years. I&#39;m entitled</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.807" end="00:26:06.908" style="s2">to a return on that investment.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.908" end="00:26:09.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom,</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.908" end="00:26:11.807" style="s2">let him have it.</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.408" end="00:26:11.807" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.607" end="00:26:15.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ridiculous.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.107" end="00:26:17.307" style="s2">Handing money to these parasites makes</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.807" end="00:26:18.408" style="s2">me feel dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.307" end="00:26:21.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put it away.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.408" end="00:26:21.107" style="s2">I&#39;ve got this.</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.107" end="00:26:30.307" style="s2">$5?</p>
<p begin="00:26:27.207" end="00:26:30.307" style="s2">That&#39;s what I&#39;m worth to you, right?</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.408" end="00:26:34.509" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:26:31.807" end="00:26:37.809" style="s2">I&#39;m myself back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.509" end="00:26:39.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $5. What the is this?</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.809" end="00:26:40.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It means I&#39;m done.</p>
<p begin="00:26:39.309" end="00:26:42.909" style="s2">Worked myself to the bone for this</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.509" end="00:26:45.209" style="s2">family since I was a kid. 5 bucks buys</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.909" end="00:26:47.009" style="s2">my freedom. I don&#39;t owe you a penny.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.209" end="00:26:48.909" style="s2">We&#39;re not family anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.009" end="00:26:49.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ungrateful little I RAISED</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.909" end="00:26:51.809" style="s2">YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.509" end="00:26:54.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SAVE IT. EVERY penny you had went</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.809" end="00:26:54.709" style="s2">straight to Cody.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.709" end="00:26:59.809" style="s2">The only person in this house who cared</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.009" end="00:27:01.309" style="s2">about me was mom.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.809" end="00:27:03.609" style="s2">She&#39;d sneak me the change she hid from</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.309" end="00:27:03.609" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.109" end="00:27:08.609" style="s2">You You treated the strays in the alley</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.909" end="00:27:08.609" style="s2">better than me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.009" end="00:27:14.609" style="s2">And I&#39;m not just cutting ties.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.109" end="00:27:17.609" style="s2">I&#39;m taking mom.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.609" end="00:27:17.609" style="s2">She&#39;s coming to live with me.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.409" end="00:27:24.709" style="s2">Her days of being your unpaid maid,</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.409" end="00:27:24.709" style="s2">scared of setting you off, over.</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.709" end="00:27:33.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.109" end="00:27:35.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Told you I had good taste. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.009" end="00:27:35.609" style="s2">Let&#39;s follow them.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.309" end="00:27:40.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, wait. If mom leaves, who&#39;s cooking</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.109" end="00:27:40.409" style="s2">dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.709" end="00:27:44.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let that hick have her little tantrum.</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.509" end="00:27:48.909" style="s2">She&#39;s flat broke anyway. Don&#39;t worry,</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.809" end="00:27:48.909" style="s2">Cody. She&#39;ll be back before dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.109" end="00:27:56.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait here, mom. I&#39;ll get the truck.</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.609" end="00:27:58.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take my car. I&#39;ll drive you.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.709" end="00:27:59.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whose car is this? Must have cost a</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.709" end="00:28:03.009" style="s2">fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.509" end="00:28:04.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mine. I&#39;ll explain later. Get in.</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.009" end="00:28:07.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.809" end="00:28:08.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, you&#39;ve made your point.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.209" end="00:28:10.409" style="s2">Go home.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.809" end="00:28:13.509" style="s2">Make dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.409" end="00:28:16.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, dad&#39;s asking you, what kind of life</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.509" end="00:28:18.309" style="s2">can Claire and that broke guy give you?</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.609" end="00:28:19.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a rental, babe. I could rent one,</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.309" end="00:28:20.809" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.209" end="00:28:22.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.809" end="00:28:24.609" style="s2">She&#39;s with us now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.309" end="00:28:27.509" style="s2">I&#39;ll give them a life you can&#39;t imagine.</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.609" end="00:28:27.509" style="s2">Get out of our way.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.709" end="00:28:32.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You? Please. Minimum wage and three more</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.109" end="00:28:35.510" style="s2">mouths to feed, you&#39;ll end up in a</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.710" end="00:28:35.510" style="s2">cardboard box.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.210" end="00:28:40.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough of this You&#39;re coming</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.310" end="00:28:42.069" style="s2">home with me.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.049" end="00:28:42.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.669" end="00:28:44.689" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.810" end="00:28:50.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go home yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.410" end="00:28:50.210" style="s2">I&#39;ve had enough.</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.710" end="00:28:57.710" style="s2">So who&#39;s cooking dinner?</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.910" end="00:29:03.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad,</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.110" end="00:29:05.610" style="s2">I think she&#39;s really gone.</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.310" end="00:29:08.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice work, Hank. You drove mom away.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.610" end="00:29:08.510" style="s2">Who&#39;s cooking now?</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.910" end="00:29:12.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s cooking? YOU. GET YOUR ASS IN THE</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.810" end="00:29:17.110" style="s2">KITCHEN.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.810" end="00:29:20.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me? I don&#39;t cook. Cody, tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.110" end="00:29:20.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should have asked first.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.410" end="00:29:25.110" style="s2">You mind that I brought my mom?</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.410" end="00:29:27.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your family is my family, Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.110" end="00:29:29.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 miles to feed now. I&#39;ll need another</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.310" end="00:29:30.310" style="s2">job just to keep the lights on.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.310" end="00:29:31.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to worry about that</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.310" end="00:29:33.210" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.410" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that mean? Where are we going?</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.210" end="00:29:36.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To our new home.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.910" end="00:29:39.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t cry, grandma. Things are going to</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.410" end="00:29:39.010" style="s2">get better.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.310" end="00:29:42.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.510" end="00:29:45.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not sad, honey. It&#39;s just</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.910" end="00:29:47.515" style="s2">30 years. First time I&#39;ve ever felt</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.410" end="00:29:48.410" style="s2">free.</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.515" end="00:29:50.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.410" end="00:29:52.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I grow up, I&#39;m going to make a</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.010" end="00:29:54.810" style="s2">million dollars. Buy you the biggest</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.310" end="00:29:57.340" style="s2">house in the world, grandpa. Nobody will</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.810" end="00:29:59.360" style="s2">ever yell at you again.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.340" end="00:29:59.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.910" end="00:30:04.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re such a good girl, Maya.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.410" end="00:30:09.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray,</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.110" end="00:30:10.610" style="s2">is your place big enough for all of us?</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.310" end="00:30:12.310" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to crowd you. I can stay on</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.610" end="00:30:16.410" style="s2">a friend&#39;s couch for a few weeks.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.310" end="00:30:16.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust me. We&#39;ve got room.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.810" end="00:30:23.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re home.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.610" end="00:30:26.510" style="s2">Let me show you inside.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.910" end="00:30:29.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey,</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.210" end="00:30:33.510" style="s2">where&#39;s Claire? She was in the car when</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.910" end="00:30:33.510" style="s2">we left. I didn&#39;t see her get out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:33.610" end="00:30:37.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.010" end="00:30:42.212" style="s2">about that.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.512" end="00:30:42.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Frank, seriously? 8 grand for one run?</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.112" end="00:30:48.312" style="s2">Deal. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.612" end="00:30:50.012" style="s2">Just landed a long haul. 2,000 miles, 8</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.312" end="00:30:52.812" style="s2">grand. Got to load my truck right away.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.012" end="00:30:52.812" style="s2">Great, pull over.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.312" end="00:30:57.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.412" end="00:30:59.612" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to work yourself to death</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.612" end="00:31:00.912" style="s2">anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.612" end="00:31:02.712" style="s2">I&#39;m actually</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.912" end="00:31:04.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, we&#39;ve got a whole family counting</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.712" end="00:31:06.112" style="s2">on us. If I don&#39;t hustle, how do we feed</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.612" end="00:31:07.912" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.112" end="00:31:11.512" style="s2">Just a few days.</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.912" end="00:31:11.512" style="s2">Look after mom and Maya for me, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.712" end="00:31:16.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go pick a room you like.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.286" end="00:31:20.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.512" end="00:31:21.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great. Did you really buy this place?</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.212" end="00:31:25.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Morgan,</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.512" end="00:31:27.212" style="s2">everything is ready as you requested.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.312" end="00:31:29.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome home, Bonnie.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.212" end="00:31:31.912" style="s2">You and Maya can finally breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.512" end="00:31:33.312" style="s2">This is all yours now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.912" end="00:31:34.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire says you moved boxes in a</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.312" end="00:31:36.012" style="s2">warehouse,</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.612" end="00:31:39.812" style="s2">but that butler just called you Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.012" end="00:31:41.912" style="s2">Morgan. Who are you exactly?</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.812" end="00:31:44.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not a mover. You&#39;re the boss,</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.912" end="00:31:44.512" style="s2">aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.312" end="00:31:47.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That obvious?</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.912" end="00:31:49.012" style="s2">Apparently the butler handled my</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.912" end="00:31:52.512" style="s2">introduction.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.012" end="00:31:55.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watch TV. Secret billionaire stepdad?</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.512" end="00:31:57.412" style="s2">Classic plot twist.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.912" end="00:31:58.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The boss Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.412" end="00:32:02.512" style="s2">So you make</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.912" end="00:32:02.512" style="s2">what, 100,000 a month?</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.112" end="00:32:08.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s just say I can keep our lights on</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.812" end="00:32:08.212" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.812" end="00:32:13.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom still thinks we&#39;re broke. When are</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.912" end="00:32:14.912" style="s2">you telling her the truth?</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.112" end="00:32:17.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When she&#39;s back from this run, I&#39;ll come</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.912" end="00:32:18.612" style="s2">clean. Until then, let yourselves be</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.412" end="00:32:22.012" style="s2">spoiled.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.612" end="00:32:22.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome home, Mrs. Doyle.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.912" end="00:32:28.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woah, woah. No, no, I can do that</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.712" end="00:32:30.612" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.312" end="00:32:31.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My shoes are muddy. Don&#39;t get your hands</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.612" end="00:32:34.012" style="s2">dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.112" end="00:32:38.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, it&#39;s our duty. You&#39;ve had a long</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.012" end="00:32:38.312" style="s2">journey. You deserve to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.713" end="00:32:50.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the children&#39;s private equestrian</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.113" end="00:32:50.013" style="s2">tutor is scheduled for tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.713" end="00:32:55.713" style="s2">Sir, your private jet is fueled and</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.913" end="00:32:57.613" style="s2">ready for departure.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.713" end="00:33:01.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whole family&#39;s counting on me back home.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.613" end="00:33:01.013" style="s2">All right, let&#39;s get to work.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.113" end="00:33:07.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, the chef has finalized tonight&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.913" end="00:33:07.813" style="s2">Michelin dinner menu.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.613" end="00:33:16.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Doyle, can&#39;t you sit down and have a</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.713" end="00:33:18.213" style="s2">proper meal?</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.613" end="00:33:19.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m making money, Mike. No time to waste</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.213" end="00:33:21.413" style="s2">in restaurants.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.213" end="00:33:23.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a workaholic.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.413" end="00:33:25.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two days without a call. Wonder how</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.113" end="00:33:25.713" style="s2">mom&#39;s doing.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.213" end="00:33:33.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, your daughter&#39;s calling.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.213" end="00:33:35.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.713" end="00:33:37.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.713" end="00:33:38.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How have you been? Gray taking good care</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.513" end="00:33:40.213" style="s2">of you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.413" end="00:33:43.313" style="s2">Wonderful, honey. Can&#39;t remember the</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.213" end="00:33:44.713" style="s2">last time I felt this relaxed.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.313" end="00:33:46.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.713" end="00:33:48.513" style="s2">Mom, is that a pool behind you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.513" end="00:33:49.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, yes. There&#39;s a hot tub next to it,</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.513" end="00:33:50.513" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.113" end="00:33:51.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? What are you wearing? Where are</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.513" end="00:33:53.413" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.513" end="00:33:55.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, just at home.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.413" end="00:33:57.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray, two grand a month box moving Gray?</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.613" end="00:33:59.713" style="s2">He got you a mansion with staff, mom.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.513" end="00:34:01.813" style="s2">Are you being scammed?</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.713" end="00:34:03.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray arranged everything. A few days</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.813" end="00:34:06.113" style="s2">ago, I was scrubbing Hank&#39;s floors.</p>
<p begin="00:34:03.913" end="00:34:07.513" style="s2">Never seen a house like this in my life.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.113" end="00:34:09.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And we have maids now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.513" end="00:34:11.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why would I lie? I sent you the address.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.413" end="00:34:12.813" style="s2">Come see for yourself. Got to go. Time</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.713" end="00:34:15.513" style="s2">for my neck massage.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.813" end="00:34:18.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, wait. Don&#39;t hang</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.513" end="00:34:18.213" style="s2">This can&#39;t be real.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.313" end="00:34:22.113" style="s2">This</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.313" end="00:34:22.113" style="s2">is the address?</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.513" end="00:34:25.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.513" end="00:34:26.913" style="s2">Either Gray won the lottery or something</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.513" end="00:34:30.513" style="s2">seriously wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.913" end="00:34:30.513" style="s2">No way. There&#39;s got to be some mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.913" end="00:34:35.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, finished your run?</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.613" end="00:34:37.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray, listen. Mom sent me a new address.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.713" end="00:34:38.113" style="s2">I am outside in the state right now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.013" end="00:34:40.313" style="s2">What the hell is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.113" end="00:34:41.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re in the right place. Just knock.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.313" end="00:34:45.514" style="s2">I&#39;ll be home soon and explain</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.514" end="00:34:45.514" style="s2">everything. All right? See you shortly.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.114" end="00:34:52.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are they messing with me?</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.314" end="00:34:56.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I help you?</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.914" end="00:34:57.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m looking for my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.714" end="00:35:00.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother?</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.714" end="00:35:02.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, Bonnie Doyle and my daughter Maya</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.014" end="00:35:04.114" style="s2">Doyle. Are they inside?</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.014" end="00:35:05.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Morgan, I&#39;ll fetch them.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.114" end="00:35:06.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. They&#39;re actually in there. Asked</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.514" end="00:35:08.314" style="s2">Gray to look after them and he stuck</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.514" end="00:35:09.514" style="s2">them in a mansion.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.314" end="00:35:13.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom&#39;s back.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.514" end="00:35:13.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, good. You found us.</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.114" end="00:35:17.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you dressed like that?</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.514" end="00:35:19.714" style="s2">What are you wearing?</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.514" end="00:35:20.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, my work uniform, honey.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.714" end="00:35:22.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your uniform?</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.914" end="00:35:24.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t live in a place this nice and do</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.214" end="00:35:25.314" style="s2">nothing. I get bored. Help with the</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.014" end="00:35:26.314" style="s2">cleaning. At least I don&#39;t feel like I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.314" end="00:35:27.914" style="s2">freeloading.</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.314" end="00:35:29.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me get this straight. You&#39;re living</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.914" end="00:35:31.514" style="s2">in a multi-million dollar mansion and</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.914" end="00:35:32.414" style="s2">you volunteered to clean? What&#39;s she</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.514" end="00:35:34.614" style="s2">wearing then?</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.414" end="00:35:36.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Averil&#39;s study buddy. She got bored</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.614" end="00:35:38.114" style="s2">in class by herself and made me join</p>
<p begin="00:35:36.314" end="00:35:38.814" style="s2">her. It&#39;s nice having someone to study</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.114" end="00:35:40.414" style="s2">with.</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.814" end="00:35:43.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I&#39;m not paying you to stand around</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.414" end="00:35:44.814" style="s2">chatting. Get to work. And you, back to</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.114" end="00:35:47.214" style="s2">the study.</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.814" end="00:35:50.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.214" end="00:35:52.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, you&#39;re back. Pizza tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.114" end="00:35:54.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ow, ow, ow. Wait. I&#39;ve been hauling</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.114" end="00:35:57.114" style="s2">freight for weeks. My back&#39;s killing me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.714" end="00:36:00.014" style="s2">I get home and my mom and daughter are</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.114" end="00:36:02.014" style="s2">running around your house in uniforms.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.014" end="00:36:03.914" style="s2">10 minutes. Explain.</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.014" end="00:36:05.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I swear they asked. Your mom said she&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.914" end="00:36:06.714" style="s2">go crazy with nothing to do. Maya and</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.314" end="00:36:07.114" style="s2">Averil have been inseparable since day</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.714" end="00:36:09.814" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.114" end="00:36:09.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 9 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.214" end="00:36:13.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 9 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.614" end="00:36:15.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maya, help me. Your mother&#39;s back</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.114" end="00:36:18.514" style="s2">tomorrow. Diamond ring or necklace?</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.414" end="00:36:19.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to keep the dad title? Buy nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.514" end="00:36:21.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. Why?</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.914" end="00:36:23.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My mom hates liars. She finds out you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.814" end="00:36:23.914" style="s2">been pretending to be broke, you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.214" end="00:36:25.814" style="s2">dead.</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.914" end="00:36:27.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to fix this fast.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.814" end="00:36:30.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, don&#39;t blame Gray. I couldn&#39;t sit</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.814" end="00:36:31.914" style="s2">still. Insisted on finding work. Little</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.514" end="00:36:33.914" style="s2">spending money, too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.914" end="00:36:35.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just taking classes with Averil. She</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.914" end="00:36:38.414" style="s2">gets company. I get free private</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.914" end="00:36:40.214" style="s2">tutoring. Win win. Why wouldn&#39;t I?</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.414" end="00:36:41.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray&#39;s been working so hard, Claire,</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.214" end="00:36:43.516" style="s2">taking every delivery, sweating right</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.814" end="00:36:44.016" style="s2">through his shirts, all to save some</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.516" end="00:36:45.416" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.016" end="00:36:47.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saving for what? I&#39;ve been covering the</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.416" end="00:36:48.816" style="s2">bills.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.116" end="00:36:50.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To buy you this.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.816" end="00:36:52.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You bought me this?</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.716" end="00:36:55.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You deserve a diamond.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.716" end="00:36:57.816" style="s2">Seems we skipped the whole wedding part.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.516" end="00:37:00.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; what were you thinking? We can&#39;t afford</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.816" end="00:37:02.816" style="s2">this kind of luxury.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.816" end="00:37:03.816" style="s2">Okay, not going to lie, it&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.816" end="00:37:05.516" style="s2">How much?</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.816" end="00:37:08.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not much, 2,000.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.516" end="00:37:09.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2,000? Are you crazy? That&#39;s a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.016" end="00:37:11.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell her it&#39;s 20 million, she&#39;ll skin me</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.316" end="00:37:13.016" style="s2">alive. Right, for my own survival, the</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.416" end="00:37:13.616" style="s2">billionaire secret stays locked in the</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.016" end="00:37:15.516" style="s2">vault.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.616" end="00:37:16.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You idiot. You&#39;re my idiot.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.516" end="00:37:20.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.916" end="00:37:22.016" style="s2">Anything you want, I&#39;ll get it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.216" end="00:37:23.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, I finished collecting the recycling</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.016" end="00:37:24.616" style="s2">on the whole street.</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.400" end="00:37:26.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.616" end="00:37:27.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, you&#39;re making a little kid</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.016" end="00:37:29.916" style="s2">dig through trash?</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.416" end="00:37:31.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve taken this act way too far.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.916" end="00:37:33.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we all pitch in and stick together,</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.516" end="00:37:35.616" style="s2">this family will be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.916" end="00:37:37.716" style="s2">You&#39;re right. We&#39;ll get through this.</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.616" end="00:37:41.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gray Morgan, please give Whitmill</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.716" end="00:37:41.116" style="s2">Group one chance to work with you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.316" end="00:37:45.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You called him Gray Morgan?</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.016" end="00:37:46.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, Claire, I&#39;m something of a</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.416" end="00:37:48.716" style="s2">legend in freight, independent</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.816" end="00:37:49.416" style="s2">contractor, the CEO of heavy lifting, if</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.716" end="00:37:51.716" style="s2">you will.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.416" end="00:37:53.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CEO of heavy lifting? Sure. Then what&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.716" end="00:37:55.016" style="s2">this partnership he&#39;s begging you for?</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.116" end="00:37:56.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, that. Big warehouse to clear out,</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.016" end="00:37:58.416" style="s2">needed the best man for the job,</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.616" end="00:38:01.016" style="s2">insisted on coming in person.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.416" end="00:38:04.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He drove all this way in a luxury car to</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.016" end="00:38:05.816" style="s2">hire one guy to move boxes?</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.016" end="00:38:06.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m efficient, excellent reviews. Go</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.816" end="00:38:08.116" style="s2">warm up the truck. I&#39;ll work out the</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.916" end="00:38:10.716" style="s2">logistics with Richard here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.116" end="00:38:11.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. So, Mr. Morgan, heavy freight,</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.716" end="00:38:15.316" style="s2">do we have a deal?</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.616" end="00:38:15.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal. We&#39;ll discuss the boxes tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.416" end="00:38:17.116" style="s2">Did I just land a deal with Morgan</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.616" end="00:38:19.616" style="s2">Group?</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.116" end="00:38:19.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.516" end="00:38:26.916" style="s2">This rental&#39;s so small you can&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.116" end="00:38:29.016" style="s2">fit a twin bed. Pack up and bring the</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.916" end="00:38:32.216" style="s2">kids to mine. It&#39;s a dump, but at least</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.016" end="00:38:32.216" style="s2">we won&#39;t sleep on top of each other.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.316" end="00:38:37.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.816" end="00:38:40.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, your phone. Ryan Ashford, my dad.</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.516" end="00:38:41.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell does he want now?</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.216" end="00:38:43.016" style="s2">What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.116" end="00:38:43.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put Maya on. Didn&#39;t call to hear your</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.016" end="00:38:44.416" style="s2">voice.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.966" end="00:38:48.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.416" end="00:38:52.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feeling&#39;s mutual. Hey, what did say?</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.117" end="00:38:52.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hi, dad. Okay, I&#39;ll think about it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.917" end="00:38:55.617" style="s2">He&#39;s getting married, wants me at the</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.917" end="00:38:57.817" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.617" end="00:39:00.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The nerve of that man. Drank his</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.817" end="00:39:02.717" style="s2">paychecks, gambled away the rent. Did he</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.517" end="00:39:04.117" style="s2">ever look after Maya?</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.717" end="00:39:06.217" style="s2">Now he&#39;s getting married, wants his</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.117" end="00:39:08.317" style="s2">daughter there to play dad of the year.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.217" end="00:39:09.417" style="s2">Not a chan</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.317" end="00:39:10.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.417" end="00:39:11.617" style="s2">Do you want to go?</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.617" end="00:39:13.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.617" end="00:39:15.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure? Because if you want to, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.217" end="00:39:16.717" style="s2">take you. See what kind of show</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.017" end="00:39:18.917" style="s2">your father&#39;s living now.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.717" end="00:39:22.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.917" end="00:39:22.017" style="s2">Good. Off to bed.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.017" end="00:39:27.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, well, if it isn&#39;t my lovely</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.117" end="00:39:29.117" style="s2">ex-wife, Claire. Get lost on your way to</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.717" end="00:39:30.317" style="s2">the trailer park.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.117" end="00:39:32.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, who&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.317" end="00:39:34.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meet my beautiful wife, Sloan. Sloan,</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.017" end="00:39:34.917" style="s2">this is Claire, the tomboy ex I told you</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.017" end="00:39:37.017" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:39:34.917" end="00:39:38.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, the truck driver. Wow, you really</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.017" end="00:39:39.817" style="s2">went all out for the wedding. Love the</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.517" end="00:39:41.717" style="s2">casual look.</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.817" end="00:39:43.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t invite you, Claire. Thought</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.717" end="00:39:45.517" style="s2">seeing me marry someone this beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.217" end="00:39:47.217" style="s2">might make you jealous.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.517" end="00:39:49.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get over yourself, Ryan.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.217" end="00:39:51.017" style="s2">You&#39;re not the only one who&#39;s moved on.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.417" end="00:39:52.317" style="s2">I just remarried, too.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.017" end="00:39:55.217" style="s2">Only reason I&#39;m at this circus is my</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.317" end="00:39:55.217" style="s2">daughter wanted to come.</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.317" end="00:39:58.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Daddy?</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.917" end="00:40:00.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, look at you getting so tall, Maya.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.017" end="00:40:01.317" style="s2">Hold on. Here. Daddy got you something</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.217" end="00:40:03.517" style="s2">special.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.317" end="00:40:06.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t even like cars, but he actually</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.517" end="00:40:07.117" style="s2">brought me a gift. He does care.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.117" end="00:40:08.517" style="s2">Thanks, dad.</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.117" end="00:40:11.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, why are you getting my old junk? I</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.517" end="00:40:11.417" style="s2">threw THAT IN THE TRASH.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.317" end="00:40:17.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey buddy, it&#39;s okay.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.717" end="00:40:19.217" style="s2">Maya, listen. Daddy will buy you a brand</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.217" end="00:40:21.317" style="s2">new one next week.</p>
<p begin="00:40:19.217" end="00:40:23.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you said you went to the store and</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.317" end="00:40:24.717" style="s2">picked it out just for me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.117" end="00:40:26.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did pick it out. Your big brother</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.717" end="00:40:27.017" style="s2">Ethan barely touched the box. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.017" end="00:40:28.317" style="s2">practically new.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.017" end="00:40:29.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.317" end="00:40:31.217" style="s2">For a second, I thought you might</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.317" end="00:40:33.717" style="s2">actually be a decent dad today. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.217" end="00:40:35.317" style="s2">just handing Maya somebody else&#39;s trash.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.717" end="00:40:37.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. She should be grateful she got</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.317" end="00:40:39.117" style="s2">anything. Heard your new husband moves</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.217" end="00:40:41.017" style="s2">boxes for a living. That toy&#39;s half a</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.117" end="00:40:42.317" style="s2">week&#39;s pay for him, right?</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.017" end="00:40:43.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My husband&#39;s pay is none of your</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.317" end="00:40:45.317" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.617" end="00:40:47.117" style="s2">But you, Ryan,</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.317" end="00:40:48.717" style="s2">you abandoned your own kid to play dad</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.117" end="00:40:50.218" style="s2">to somebody else&#39;s.</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.717" end="00:40:52.718" style="s2">He takes your name and you win Father of</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.218" end="00:40:54.218" style="s2">the Year.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.718" end="00:40:54.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it down, Claire. Watch what you</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.218" end="00:40:56.718" style="s2">say.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.818" end="00:40:58.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I&#39;m just getting started. Thank your</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.718" end="00:41:00.118" style="s2">lucky stars it&#39;s your wedding day or I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.318" end="00:41:02.218" style="s2">have aired every last bit of your dirty</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.118" end="00:41:03.718" style="s2">laundry. You&#39;re just standing there,</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.218" end="00:41:06.118" style="s2">they&#39;re bullying your daughter and you</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.718" end="00:41:08.618" style="s2">do nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.118" end="00:41:11.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful, sweetheart. Daddy promises from</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.618" end="00:41:11.618" style="s2">now on your toys are yours. Nobody takes</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.118" end="00:41:13.918" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.618" end="00:41:15.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dad buys me anything I want. You</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.918" end="00:41:17.318" style="s2">don&#39;t even have a dad.</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.618" end="00:41:18.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Morgan,</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.318" end="00:41:19.418" style="s2">you&#39;re sure you&#39;re not going to the</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.518" end="00:41:21.018" style="s2">wedding?</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.418" end="00:41:22.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maya is facing her biological father</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.018" end="00:41:24.718" style="s2">today. It&#39;s not my place.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.818" end="00:41:27.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he&#39;s a bastard. He doesn&#39;t care</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.718" end="00:41:29.318" style="s2">about Maya at all.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.518" end="00:41:31.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t understand blood ties, Dean.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.318" end="00:41:32.418" style="s2">They leave a mark. However much he</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.018" end="00:41:34.218" style="s2">disappoints her, he&#39;s still the man who</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.418" end="00:41:37.318" style="s2">gave her life. No one has the right to</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.218" end="00:41:39.418" style="s2">erase that, not even me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.318" end="00:41:41.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, lose the long face. The kid&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.418" end="00:41:44.218" style="s2">telling the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.718" end="00:41:47.418" style="s2">Poor little orphan. Think that new man</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.218" end="00:41:50.318" style="s2">your mom dragged home cares about you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.418" end="00:41:52.418" style="s2">You&#39;re not his kid. Give him a month,</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.318" end="00:41:54.318" style="s2">he&#39;ll have you begging on the street.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.418" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you insane? You hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.318" end="00:41:57.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talk to my kid like that again, see what</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:41:59.418" style="s2">happens.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.118" end="00:42:01.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re just standing there. Do something</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.418" end="00:42:03.018" style="s2">about this psycho.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.218" end="00:42:05.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is wrong with you, Claire?</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.018" end="00:42:07.118" style="s2">Always hitting people. You&#39;re completely</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.118" end="00:42:09.618" style="s2">unhinged. Kicking you out was the best</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.118" end="00:42:11.518" style="s2">decision I ever made.</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.618" end="00:42:13.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Best decision? Let&#39;s get our history</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.518" end="00:42:15.918" style="s2">straight, Ryan. You were buried in</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.318" end="00:42:18.118" style="s2">gambling debt, bled my paycheck dry. You</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.918" end="00:42:18.718" style="s2">didn&#39;t leave. I threw your sorry ass</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.118" end="00:42:20.418" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.718" end="00:42:20.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, he was broke? Thought he was OLD</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.418" end="00:42:22.618" style="s2">MONEY.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.718" end="00:42:23.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;RE LYING. SHUT UP AND APOLOGIZE TO</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.618" end="00:42:27.918" style="s2">MY WIFE.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.518" end="00:42:27.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize to Maya first, then I will.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.118" end="00:42:33.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dream on. You hit me, Claire. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.618" end="00:42:35.218" style="s2">going to pay for that.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.118" end="00:42:37.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woah, careful. That&#39;s the VIP reserved</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.218" end="00:42:39.418" style="s2">for the penthouse. 6 million a bottle.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.918" end="00:42:40.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.418" end="00:42:42.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, are you crazy? You wrecked the</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.818" end="00:42:44.518" style="s2">hotel&#39;s whole display.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.918" end="00:42:45.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey buddy, what&#39;s that thing actually</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.518" end="00:42:47.118" style="s2">cost?</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.818" end="00:42:48.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.118" end="00:42:51.118" style="s2">six million dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.918" end="00:42:52.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six million? What&#39;s in it? Unicorn</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.118" end="00:42:52.820" style="s2">tears? Grape juice?</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.618" end="00:42:54.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.820" end="00:42:56.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; way, Mr. Ellsworth. Your 82 Lavergne is</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.520" end="00:42:58.720" style="s2">perfectly safe. We&#39;re taking it to your</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.020" end="00:42:58.720" style="s2">private suite.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.720" end="00:43:02.820" style="s2">We&#39;re having your wine sent up to your</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.920" end="00:43:05.420" style="s2">private suite right now.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.820" end="00:43:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wine? This is what you call perfectly</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.420" end="00:43:10.220" style="s2">safe?</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.520" end="00:43:11.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Ellsworth, please. I&#39;m so sorry. Go</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.220" end="00:43:12.920" style="s2">up to your suite and I swear I&#39;ll handle</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.820" end="00:43:14.320" style="s2">this immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.920" end="00:43:15.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find out</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.320" end="00:43:18.020" style="s2">who did this.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.720" end="00:43:19.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her. She knocked over the whole tray. We</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.020" end="00:43:22.220" style="s2">all saw it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.020" end="00:43:22.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. All her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.320" end="00:43:29.420" style="s2">Security.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.920" end="00:43:30.920" style="s2">Pull the footage now.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.420" end="00:43:33.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, this isn&#39;t how this is supposed to</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.920" end="00:43:35.120" style="s2">go. Come on. Is that necessary? Those</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.520" end="00:43:37.020" style="s2">cameras are always blurry anyway. 50</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.120" end="00:43:38.620" style="s2">witnesses here saw her break it. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.020" end="00:43:39.820" style="s2">waste Mr. Ellsworth&#39;s time. We know who</p>
<p begin="00:43:38.620" end="00:43:41.920" style="s2">did it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.820" end="00:43:44.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What, you think I&#39;m some idiot soap</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.920" end="00:43:45.925" style="s2">opera villain who refuses to look at</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.020" end="00:43:46.620" style="s2">evidence?</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.925" end="00:43:49.220" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.620" end="00:43:51.520" style="s2">Play it. Clear as day. You tripped the</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.220" end="00:43:53.920" style="s2">server. She hit the wine rack. Shared</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.520" end="00:43:56.020" style="s2">liability. $3 million each. $6 million</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.920" end="00:43:59.820" style="s2">total. We accept wire transfers.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.020" end="00:44:01.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations. You played yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.820" end="00:44:03.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $3 million is ridiculous. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.920" end="00:44:04.820" style="s2">Surely there&#39;s a discount for a</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.220" end="00:44:06.620" style="s2">misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:44:04.820" end="00:44:07.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Swipe your card, Ryan. We&#39;re sick of</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.620" end="00:44:10.020" style="s2">hearing it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.520" end="00:44:11.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up, Claire. Think this is funny?</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.020" end="00:44:14.220" style="s2">You owe the same damn amount.</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.620" end="00:44:15.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? You pay. I pay. Worst case, we</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.220" end="00:44:17.720" style="s2">share a cell.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.220" end="00:44:19.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Negotiations are over. Pay now or the</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.720" end="00:44:22.020" style="s2">police can explain the bill.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.520" end="00:44:23.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Don&#39;t call the cops. I&#39;ve got money.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.020" end="00:44:26.320" style="s2">Here.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.420" end="00:44:27.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Approved. $3 million received.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.320" end="00:44:28.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You actually had that much cash sitting</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.720" end="00:44:31.120" style="s2">around?</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.720" end="00:44:32.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Since dumping you, I&#39;ve built</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.120" end="00:44:34.720" style="s2">some real wealth.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.520" end="00:44:36.620" style="s2">$3 million? I make that in a year.</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.720" end="00:44:37.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your turn, honey. Let&#39;s see you match</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.620" end="00:44:39.520" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.220" end="00:44:41.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your $300,000, cash or card.</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.520" end="00:44:45.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said you&#39;d pay if we&#39;d paid, Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.620" end="00:44:45.220" style="s2">We just settled up. Your turn.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.320" end="00:44:50.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me a second. $42? Sure. Let me just</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.720" end="00:44:52.320" style="s2">conjure up $3 million. What&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.520" end="00:44:54.220" style="s2">halter? We don&#39;t have all day to watch</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.320" end="00:44:54.721" style="s2">you count pennies.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.220" end="00:44:55.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.721" end="00:44:57.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; done.</p>
<p begin="00:44:55.521" end="00:44:58.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Gray, you need to come here right</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.721" end="00:45:00.921" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.621" end="00:45:03.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pathetic. Champagne taste on an empty</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.921" end="00:45:03.521" style="s2">wallet.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.121" end="00:45:08.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t pay.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.821" end="00:45:11.121" style="s2">Take me to jail.</p>
<p begin="00:45:08.221" end="00:45:11.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, no.</p>
<p begin="00:45:11.521" end="00:45:13.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.386" end="00:45:15.421" style="s2">[snorts] Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.921" end="00:45:17.021" style="s2">You&#39;ll be good while I&#39;m in jail, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.421" end="00:45:18.321" style="s2">Make sure you eat your dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.021" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">I&#39;ll come straight back for you when I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.321" end="00:45:22.421" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.021" end="00:45:22.421" style="s2">Be good.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.521" end="00:45:26.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody stop.</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.521" end="00:45:27.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray?</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.721" end="00:45:29.121" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.721" end="00:45:32.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what the matter is. We will take</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.121" end="00:45:32.121" style="s2">care of our family.</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.921" end="00:45:39.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at him.</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.821" end="00:45:40.921" style="s2">Looks even more broke than you, Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.321" end="00:45:42.621" style="s2">How&#39;s a guy like that supposed to save</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.921" end="00:45:44.321" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.621" end="00:45:46.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What can I do? You&#39;d be surprised.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.321" end="00:45:48.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That bottle we broke, $3 million.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.621" end="00:45:49.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you I&#39;ll handle it. Whose bottle</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.321" end="00:45:51.321" style="s2">was it?</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.121" end="00:45:52.341" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Victor Ellinson&#39;s, Interstellar</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.321" end="00:45:54.361" style="s2">Group.</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.341" end="00:45:54.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.221" end="00:45:58.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me a minute. I&#39;ll be right back.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.221" end="00:46:03.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please. He&#39;s the CEO of Interstellar</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.521" end="00:46:05.221" style="s2">Group. You think he&#39;d waste time on a</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.221" end="00:46:07.321" style="s2">box mover? Dream on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.221" end="00:46:10.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him dig his own grave. Can&#39;t wait to</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.321" end="00:46:10.321" style="s2">see how this ends.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.021" end="00:46:13.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s been in there too long. Why isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.421" end="00:46:15.921" style="s2">he coming out?</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.721" end="00:46:17.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, breathe. Gray should have it sorted</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.921" end="00:46:19.421" style="s2">any minute.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.521" end="00:46:20.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorted, please. He&#39;s probably on his</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.421" end="00:46:21.221" style="s2">knees begging them not to break his</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.621" end="00:46:22.721" style="s2">legs.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.221" end="00:46:24.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s life when you&#39;re poor, Claire.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.721" end="00:46:24.521" style="s2">Can&#39;t pay the bill? Pay with your</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.021" end="00:46:26.321" style="s2">dignity.</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.521" end="00:46:28.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like hell. Pick on me all you want.</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.321" end="00:46:29.921" style="s2">Nobody humiliates my man.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.421" end="00:46:32.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, gentlemen.</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.921" end="00:46:34.972" style="s2">I don&#39;t have a penny. Have mercy.</p>
<p begin="00:46:32.952" end="00:46:34.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.821" end="00:46:44.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.921" end="00:46:46.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t miss this show. Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:44.521" end="00:46:49.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray, I&#39;m getting YOU OUT OF HERE. GRAY,</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.321" end="00:46:50.621" style="s2">I&#39;M here to save you. Hang on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.221" end="00:46:53.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell&#39;s going on in here?</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.621" end="00:46:55.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey. Nothing serious. Had a word with</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.221" end="00:46:57.023" style="s2">these gentlemen. Turns out they&#39;re very</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.021" end="00:46:58.523" style="s2">reasonable. They&#39;ve waived the entire</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.023" end="00:47:00.523" style="s2">bill, haven&#39;t you, gentlemen?</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.523" end="00:47:02.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, Mr. Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.523" end="00:47:04.422" style="s2">I make eight figures a year, and I threw</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.122" end="00:47:05.122" style="s2">a fit over 3 million, embarrassing,</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.422" end="00:47:06.523" style="s2">petty of me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.122" end="00:47:08.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Absolutely, Ms. Doyle. We&#39;re deeply</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.523" end="00:47:09.723" style="s2">sorry for the misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.023" end="00:47:11.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you kidding me? She gets off for</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.723" end="00:47:13.422" style="s2">free? What about the 3 MILLION WE JUST</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.523" end="00:47:15.223" style="s2">WIRED YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.422" end="00:47:17.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EXACTLY, MR. ELLSWORTHY. Since</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.223" end="00:47:18.323" style="s2">everyone&#39;s being so generous, we&#39;d like</p>
<p begin="00:47:17.023" end="00:47:21.622" style="s2">our refund now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.323" end="00:47:23.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A refund? Absolutely not. Consider that</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.622" end="00:47:25.922" style="s2">3 million tuition. Perhaps it&#39;ll teach</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.922" end="00:47:27.723" style="s2">your wife to keep her hands to herself.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.922" end="00:47:29.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you joking? Why do they get a free</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.723" end="00:47:30.922" style="s2">pass? Shut up. Want him coming after us</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.723" end="00:47:34.023" style="s2">for all 6 million?</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.922" end="00:47:35.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drop it. All settled. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.023" end="00:47:36.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, damn. Some of these suits do have</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.523" end="00:47:37.922" style="s2">a conscience.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.223" end="00:47:40.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maya, wait.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.922" end="00:47:42.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want now?</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.422" end="00:47:44.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just a minute alone with my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.523" end="00:47:46.323" style="s2">Maya, sweetheart, listen.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.422" end="00:47:49.323" style="s2">Next time, I&#39;ll get you that new toy you</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.323" end="00:47:51.223" style="s2">want, the really expensive one, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.323" end="00:47:54.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t play with toys anymore, and I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.223" end="00:47:56.323" style="s2">got a dad now. He buys me what I want.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.622" end="00:47:57.422" style="s2">Save your money for your new baby. I</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.323" end="00:48:00.323" style="s2">don&#39;t want it.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.422" end="00:48:01.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go home, Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.323" end="00:48:02.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.422" end="00:48:04.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You disappeared for her whole childhood,</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.823" end="00:48:06.122" style="s2">Ryan. Nobody waits forever, not even</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.723" end="00:48:07.422" style="s2">your own flesh and blood.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.122" end="00:48:09.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.422" end="00:48:11.122" style="s2">Too close. Nearly got blacklisted by the</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.523" end="00:48:12.622" style="s2">entire Morgan Group.</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.122" end="00:48:14.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me about it. Man controls half the</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.622" end="00:48:15.422" style="s2">industry. Why dress like a day laborer?</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.223" end="00:48:18.223" style="s2">Some weird role play thing with his</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.422" end="00:48:18.223" style="s2">wife, probably.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.323" end="00:48:21.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.422" end="00:48:24.223" style="s2">back there,</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.823" end="00:48:25.523" style="s2">did you mean it when you called me</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.223" end="00:48:28.523" style="s2">Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.523" end="00:48:30.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are my dad, right? Right?</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.523" end="00:48:31.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.122" end="00:48:33.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been a dad for 5 years. Play it</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.922" end="00:48:35.323" style="s2">cool, will you?</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.023" end="00:48:37.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t understand. 1 year with my</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.323" end="00:48:39.523" style="s2">biological daughter is one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.622" end="00:48:42.223" style="s2">A girl who&#39;s not related to me calling</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.523" end="00:48:43.622" style="s2">me dad, that&#39;s something else entirely.</p>
<p begin="00:48:42.223" end="00:48:45.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, can you buy me something?</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.622" end="00:48:45.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything. Name your price, sweetheart,</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.122" end="00:48:47.622" style="s2">whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.922" end="00:48:49.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 sets of full-length ACT practice</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.622" end="00:48:49.723" style="s2">tests, Barron&#39;s and Princeton Review,</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.122" end="00:48:51.023" style="s2">preferably.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.723" end="00:48:53.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, what?</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.023" end="00:48:56.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No mom again, Avril? You sure you</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.323" end="00:48:56.422" style="s2">actually have one?</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.323" end="00:49:00.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avril?</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.223" end="00:49:00.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, my mom&#39;s here. Mom!</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.023" end="00:49:02.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finished</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.224" end="00:49:04.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; work early. Thought I&#39;d pick you up.</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.224" end="00:49:04.924" style="s2">A treat for you.</p>
<p begin="00:49:05.624" end="00:49:09.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. Dad never lets me eat anything</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.824" end="00:49:11.824" style="s2">that isn&#39;t from a fancy restaurant. Says</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.924" end="00:49:14.924" style="s2">it violates the health code.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.824" end="00:49:14.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Try it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.224" end="00:49:20.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Avril, that&#39;s your mom?</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.024" end="00:49:22.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep. She drove her truck here to get me</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.224" end="00:49:24.624" style="s2">and she bought me this.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.324" end="00:49:26.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This place is a palace. Your school must</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.624" end="00:49:29.524" style="s2">cost a fortune.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.924" end="00:49:32.024" style="s2">Global elite, huh? Tell your dad to lay</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.524" end="00:49:34.524" style="s2">off the sci-fi movies.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.024" end="00:49:35.724" style="s2">Claire Claire Doyle? Oh my god, is that</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.524" end="00:49:38.724" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.724" end="00:49:41.924" style="s2">Diane Silvering. Must be 10 years. You</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.724" end="00:49:44.024" style="s2">look so Well, you look exactly the same.</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.924" end="00:49:45.924" style="s2">Wait, your kid goes here? Claire, this</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.024" end="00:49:47.824" style="s2">is an elite academy. Base tuition alone</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.924" end="00:49:49.424" style="s2">is $2 million a year.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.824" end="00:49:51.224" style="s2">A warehouse worker couldn&#39;t I mean, that</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.424" end="00:49:52.324" style="s2">doesn&#39;t How Who&#39;s paying for this?</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.224" end="00:49:53.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.324" end="00:49:55.224" style="s2">$2 million?</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.424" end="00:49:57.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s just tuition. Add meals,</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.224" end="00:49:59.934" style="s2">equestrian fees, the mandatory annual</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.224" end="00:50:00.324" style="s2">fund, over $3 million a year.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.934" end="00:50:02.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.324" end="00:50:03.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $3 million? [laughter] Okay, Diane, very</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.424" end="00:50:07.124" style="s2">funny. Trying to scare the blue-collar</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.624" end="00:50:09.424" style="s2">girl. Is this a joke? $3 million.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.124" end="00:50:10.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What school costs $3 million?</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.424" end="00:50:14.124" style="s2">My husband and I couldn&#39;t make that in</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.824" end="00:50:16.424" style="s2">eight lifetimes. Eight lifetimes, Diane.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.124" end="00:50:18.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, you&#39;re home late. I saved you</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.424" end="00:50:19.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $3 million.</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.524" end="00:50:22.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.324" end="00:50:24.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $3 million, Gray. A year. That&#39;s what</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.024" end="00:50:25.624" style="s2">Avril&#39;s school costs.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.424" end="00:50:28.224" style="s2">Ran into an old friend outside the</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.624" end="00:50:29.824" style="s2">academy today. That car you drive, that</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.224" end="00:50:31.124" style="s2">mansion you&#39;ve been to, kept telling</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.824" end="00:50:33.124" style="s2">myself there was some explanation. I</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.124" end="00:50:34.624" style="s2">just wasn&#39;t ready to ask. But $3 million</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.124" end="00:50:36.424" style="s2">a year for school? I want to hear it</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.624" end="00:50:39.024" style="s2">from you right now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.424" end="00:50:41.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.024" end="00:50:42.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t tell me to sit. Talk.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.024" end="00:50:44.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The school&#39;s mine. The car&#39;s mine. The</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.724" end="00:50:45.824" style="s2">mansion, too. All of it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.124" end="00:50:47.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew something was wrong. Just didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.824" end="00:50:48.824" style="s2">want to believe I could be this wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.324" end="00:50:50.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hid who I was because I needed to know</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.824" end="00:50:52.524" style="s2">if someone would accept me in Avril. Not</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.324" end="00:50:55.524" style="s2">my money, not the Morgan name.</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.524" end="00:50:57.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still lied to me every single day.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.524" end="00:50:58.824" style="s2">You watched me unload freight in</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.224" end="00:51:01.424" style="s2">freezing rain,</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.824" end="00:51:03.925" style="s2">put groceries back one by one to save a</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.424" end="00:51:05.325" style="s2">few dollars to buy you new work boots</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.925" end="00:51:07.825" style="s2">and you</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.325" end="00:51:09.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought we were starting from nothing,</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.825" end="00:51:11.325" style="s2">BUILDING A FAMILY. I THOUGHT WE were in</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.725" end="00:51:12.625" style="s2">this together.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.325" end="00:51:14.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are in this together.</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.625" end="00:51:15.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mommy, don&#39;t hit him. Daddy wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.325" end="00:51:18.325" style="s2">trying to be mean. He just wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.725" end="00:51:21.325" style="s2">find me a real mom. The other women only</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.325" end="00:51:23.525" style="s2">liked his big cars and his money.</p>
<p begin="00:51:21.325" end="00:51:26.125" style="s2">He really did carry those heavy boxes</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.525" end="00:51:28.525" style="s2">with you. His hands bled for a whole</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.125" end="00:51:30.625" style="s2">week. He said it was worth it because</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.525" end="00:51:32.525" style="s2">you bought him Band-Aids.</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.625" end="00:51:34.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it means keeping you,</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.525" end="00:51:36.825" style="s2">I&#39;ll carry them for the rest of my life.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.725" end="00:51:38.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you done hugging yet?</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.825" end="00:51:42.325" style="s2">Does this mean I don&#39;t have to go on</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.625" end="00:51:44.125" style="s2">those awful dates for you anymore?</p>
<p begin="00:51:42.325" end="00:51:45.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, kiddo.</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.125" end="00:51:46.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire, there&#39;s something else, nothing</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.925" end="00:51:48.225" style="s2">to do with money.</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.725" end="00:51:49.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What now? Bought the moon too?</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.225" end="00:51:51.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s Ava. Her mother was the Bennett</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.625" end="00:51:51.925" style="s2">family&#39;s youngest daughter. She died the</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.025" end="00:51:53.925" style="s2">night Ava was born.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.925" end="00:51:56.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bennett? Wait, the people who own half</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.925" end="00:51:58.025" style="s2">the coast?</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.225" end="00:52:00.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For 10 years, they&#39;ve been searching for</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.025" end="00:52:01.725" style="s2">their only blood heir. I built the</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.025" end="00:52:02.825" style="s2">Morgan Empire to put a wall between them</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.725" end="00:52:04.225" style="s2">and Ava.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.825" end="00:52:05.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But they found her anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.225" end="00:52:07.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just got word. They&#39;re filing for</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.925" end="00:52:08.225" style="s2">custody. But</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.125" end="00:52:10.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.225" end="00:52:11.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darlene Bennett, the family&#39;s eldest</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.125" end="00:52:14.325" style="s2">daughter. She&#39;s working behind the</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.625" end="00:52:15.725" style="s2">scenes to take Ava from me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.325" end="00:52:17.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen, Morgan.</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.725" end="00:52:18.625" style="s2">I didn&#39;t marry a billionaire for his</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.125" end="00:52:21.025" style="s2">money. I don&#39;t care about your bank</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.625" end="00:52:22.625" style="s2">balance. Ava&#39;s my kid now too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.025" end="00:52:24.425" style="s2">Some rich hiding in the shadows</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.625" end="00:52:27.925" style="s2">thinks she can take our girl, I&#39;ll drive</p>
<p begin="00:52:24.425" end="00:52:27.925" style="s2">my rig straight through her front gate.</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.125" end="00:52:34.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, 3 seconds to get off my property or</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.225" end="00:52:36.225" style="s2">I break your legs.</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.225" end="00:52:37.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wasn&#39;t my idea. I didn&#39;t want to come. I</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.225" end="00:52:39.825" style="s2">swear to God, it was</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.925" end="00:52:42.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 seconds to give me a name or I break</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.825" end="00:52:43.925" style="s2">your jaw. 1 2</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.025" end="00:52:45.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darlene, Darlene Bennett froze my</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.925" end="00:52:47.725" style="s2">accounts, dug up offshore accounting</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.925" end="00:52:49.225" style="s2">issues from 5 years ago, threatened to</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.725" end="00:52:50.325" style="s2">wipe out my branch of shares. I had no</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.225" end="00:52:51.625" style="s2">choice.</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.325" end="00:52:53.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does she want?</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.625" end="00:52:54.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The inheritance.</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.025" end="00:52:57.025" style="s2">Legal guardianship of Ava it gives her</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.525" end="00:52:58.425" style="s2">control of Ava&#39;s proxy voting rates.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.025" end="00:53:00.625" style="s2">Then she&#39;ll use her shares to trigger a</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.425" end="00:53:02.825" style="s2">full asset restructuring, strip everyone</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.625" end="00:53:04.327" style="s2">else in the family clean.</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.825" end="00:53:07.027" style="s2">It&#39;s a hostile takeover disguised as a</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.327" end="00:53:07.027" style="s2">custody battle.</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.327" end="00:53:12.327" style="s2">All the shell accounts are in there. She</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.827" end="00:53:12.327" style="s2">finds that I came here, I&#39;m dead.</p>
<p begin="00:53:18.627" end="00:53:22.127" style="s2">Darlene Bennett&#39;s been draining Morgan</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.327" end="00:53:23.827" style="s2">Subedaries for months.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.127" end="00:53:25.727" style="s2">If she gets Avalis proxy vote, she&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.827" end="00:53:27.727" style="s2">make the theft legal.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.727" end="00:53:29.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s moving capital on paper,</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.727" end="00:53:31.927" style="s2">but a real supply chain at that scale,</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.627" end="00:53:34.227" style="s2">can&#39;t fake that.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.927" end="00:53:35.527" style="s2">Hundreds of millions. I&#39;ve driven trucks</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.227" end="00:53:37.427" style="s2">for 10 years.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.527" end="00:53:39.427" style="s2">Darlene funnels that much in assets into</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.427" end="00:53:40.527" style="s2">shell companies, actual freight has to</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.427" end="00:53:42.127" style="s2">move too.</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.527" end="00:53:45.027" style="s2">Otherwise, the IRS finds empty</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.127" end="00:53:46.427" style="s2">warehouses and she&#39;s doing federal time.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.027" end="00:53:48.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think she left a paper trail on the</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.427" end="00:53:49.727" style="s2">road?</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.227" end="00:53:51.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know she did.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.727" end="00:53:53.427" style="s2">3 years ago, Morgan Logistics had a</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.627" end="00:53:55.827" style="s2">massive routing anomaly on the East</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.427" end="00:53:55.827" style="s2">Coast.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.427" end="00:54:00.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cash under the table. Nobody asks</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.227" end="00:54:00.727" style="s2">questions.</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.227" end="00:54:08.837" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve kept a copy of the electronic bill</p>
<p begin="00:54:06.827" end="00:54:09.727" style="s2">of lading for every load I&#39;ve hauled.</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.837" end="00:54:11.427" style="s2">[snorts] If she&#39;s moving phantom</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.727" end="00:54:14.327" style="s2">inventory, weight station and port</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.427" end="00:54:14.327" style="s2">records won&#39;t match.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.027" end="00:54:21.027" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.127" end="00:54:23.227" style="s2">A class A cargo manifest. 50 containers</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.027" end="00:54:25.027" style="s2">sent to a shell facility in Delaware</p>
<p begin="00:54:23.227" end="00:54:27.327" style="s2">should have cleared customs, but the</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.027" end="00:54:29.427" style="s2">port registration field&#39;s blank. Someone</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.327" end="00:54:32.327" style="s2">bypassed the port authority, signed off</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.427" end="00:54:33.227" style="s2">on the transfer manually.</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.327" end="00:54:38.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.227" end="00:54:38.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just one initial. It&#39;s G.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.327" end="00:54:44.527" style="s2">G for Gray.</p>
<p begin="00:54:41.327" end="00:54:47.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50 containers bypassed customs straight</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.527" end="00:54:47.827" style="s2">to a shell company in Delaware.</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.227" end="00:54:52.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And whoever signed had enough pull to</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.827" end="00:54:53.727" style="s2">make the port authority look away.</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.027" end="00:54:55.827" style="s2">Something you want to tell me?</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.727" end="00:54:58.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at the authorization code.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.827" end="00:55:00.027" style="s2">044.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.827" end="00:55:02.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that mean?</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.027" end="00:55:05.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A special code reserved for Morgan Group</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.627" end="00:55:07.727" style="s2">senior executives. My access was revoked</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.327" end="00:55:08.628" style="s2">10 years ago.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.727" end="00:55:10.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darlene.</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.628" end="00:55:12.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darlene has that access.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.628" end="00:55:14.728" style="s2">She&#39;s not just siphoning off family</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.128" end="00:55:16.628" style="s2">assets. She forged my initial.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.728" end="00:55:19.028" style="s2">The FBI investigates that warehouse. The</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.628" end="00:55:20.528" style="s2">paper trail leads straight to me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.028" end="00:55:23.228" style="s2">She takes the money.</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.528" end="00:55:23.228" style="s2">I go to prison.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.428" end="00:55:28.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She thinks she&#39;s covered every angle.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.328" end="00:55:31.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What she doesn&#39;t know</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.228" end="00:55:35.228" style="s2">is my network keeps offline hard copies</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.528" end="00:55:35.228" style="s2">of every class A shipment.</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.128" end="00:55:44.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wants to play dirty with your kid.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.628" end="00:55:46.728" style="s2">Let&#39;s show her what a real truck driver</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.228" end="00:55:46.728" style="s2">can do.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.228" end="00:55:54.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Print every page.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.828" end="00:55:54.128" style="s2">Time for a family reunion.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.928" end="00:56:04.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I called the family hearing, Grey. Why</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.528" end="00:56:08.128" style="s2">have you brought a woman?</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.928" end="00:56:11.828" style="s2">She&#39;ll steal my Persian rug.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.128" end="00:56:13.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My shoes are old, not dirty.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.828" end="00:56:15.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quite bold for someone who hauls</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.728" end="00:56:18.428" style="s2">freight.</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.928" end="00:56:21.028" style="s2">Adele, darling, come here.</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.428" end="00:56:22.728" style="s2">You&#39;re a Bennett. You have noble blood</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.028" end="00:56:25.528" style="s2">in your veins.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.728" end="00:56:27.628" style="s2">You belong in high society,</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.528" end="00:56:30.528" style="s2">not in a diesel truck beside a woman who</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.628" end="00:56:33.828" style="s2">buys clothes at gas stations. Come back</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.528" end="00:56:38.628" style="s2">to your real family. A trust fund,</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.828" end="00:56:41.628" style="s2">private jets, the world at your feet.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.628" end="00:56:45.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your perfume gives me a headache.</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.628" end="00:56:45.628" style="s2">You never bought me light up sneakers.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.928" end="00:56:53.428" style="s2">She picks me up in her big truck every</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.028" end="00:56:53.428" style="s2">day. She doesn&#39;t care about my blood.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.328" end="00:56:57.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.928" end="00:56:59.128" style="s2">Grey, call legal. File for emergency</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.628" end="00:57:02.328" style="s2">guardianship. I want that truck driving</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.128" end="00:57:02.328" style="s2">trash behind bars.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.028" end="00:57:11.329" style="s2">Grey, who gave you permission to</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.228" end="00:57:11.329" style="s2">interrupt my meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.929" end="00:57:18.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember those 50 containers, the forged</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.329" end="00:57:21.929" style="s2">receipts, authorization code 044.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.029" end="00:57:21.929" style="s2">I found every original record.</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.029" end="00:57:31.329" style="s2">You cooked the books in my name and</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.429" end="00:57:31.329" style="s2">expected me to take the prison sentence.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.729" end="00:57:42.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You missed something, Darlene.</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.729" end="00:57:43.629" style="s2">Invent all the freight you want on</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.429" end="00:57:46.029" style="s2">paper.</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.629" end="00:57:47.829" style="s2">Real truckers leave a record of every</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.029" end="00:57:49.629" style="s2">run.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.829" end="00:57:52.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What would a truck driver know about</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.629" end="00:57:54.529" style="s2">corporate finance?</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.229" end="00:57:56.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t know your fancy financial tricks,</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.529" end="00:57:59.129" style="s2">but I know a lie on a bill of lading</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.229" end="00:57:59.129" style="s2">when I see one.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.629" end="00:58:02.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are all original shipping records.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.829" end="00:58:05.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.929" end="00:58:08.229" style="s2">I&#39;ll testify to that. All the evidence</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.129" end="00:58:10.029" style="s2">is with the group&#39;s legal department.</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.229" end="00:58:11.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think this will drive me out of</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.029" end="00:58:12.729" style="s2">Morgan Group, Gray?</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.329" end="00:58:14.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Resign.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.729" end="00:58:16.629" style="s2">Withdraw your guardianship petition for</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.529" end="00:58:17.829" style="s2">Averett. The lawyers and investigators</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.629" end="00:58:19.029" style="s2">will pursue the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.829" end="00:58:20.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Averett,</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.029" end="00:58:22.329" style="s2">would you really rather live with this</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.529" end="00:58:24.629" style="s2">truck driver than come back to your own</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.329" end="00:58:26.729" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.629" end="00:58:29.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.729" end="00:58:32.429" style="s2">She buys me treats and picks me up from</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.629" end="00:58:33.629" style="s2">school. What do you do besides yell at</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.429" end="00:58:36.029" style="s2">people?</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.629" end="00:58:40.529" style="s2">You&#39;re nothing like a grandma. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.029" end="00:58:40.529" style="s2">more like the evil queen in Snow White.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.829" end="00:58:51.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.029" end="00:58:51.029" style="s2">how dare you betray me?</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.929" end="00:58:57.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Game over, Darlene.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.529" end="00:58:59.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think this clears your name?</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.729" end="00:59:02.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least I know when to stop lying for</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.729" end="00:59:02.029" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.529" end="00:59:09.729" style="s2">You&#39;ll regret this.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.729" end="00:59:16.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since everyone&#39;s here, allow me to make</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.731" end="00:59:16.731" style="s2">a formal introduction.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.031" end="00:59:22.631" style="s2">This is Claire Doyle,</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.831" end="00:59:25.531" style="s2">my fiance,</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.631" end="00:59:25.531" style="s2">and Avery&#39;s mother.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.331" end="00:59:33.031" style="s2">I don&#39;t care what she did for a living.</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.731" end="00:59:34.831" style="s2">I care who she is.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.031" end="00:59:37.831" style="s2">Anyone who holds her background against</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.831" end="00:59:42.331" style="s2">her will answer to me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.831" end="00:59:42.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. I picked you to be my mom.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.431" end="00:59:50.131" style="s2">Hey short stud, step on my new shoes and</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.031" end="00:59:51.231" style="s2">I&#39;m not going easy on you at trivia next</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.131" end="00:59:53.631" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.231" end="00:59:55.331" style="s2">But starting today, you&#39;re my real big</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.631" end="00:59:58.231" style="s2">sister.</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.331" end="01:00:00.576" style="s2">Fine short stud. Since it&#39;s a wedding, I</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.231" end="01:00:02.596" style="s2">guess I&#39;ll take you as my little sister.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.576" end="01:00:02.596" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.631" end="01:00:10.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.731" end="01:00:10.131" style="s2">you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.231" end="01:00:12.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.531" end="01:00:14.331" style="s2">This wedding could have brought me a</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.531" end="01:00:15.131" style="s2">brand new rig though.</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.331" end="01:00:16.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.131" end="01:00:19.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I&#39;ll write it off as a</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.931" end="01:00:19.831" style="s2">business expense.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.831" end="01:00:24.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Know what Darlene will never understand?</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.331" end="01:00:28.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.931" end="01:00:28.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t buy a family.</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.231" end="01:00:32.531" style="s2">Lose every penny tomorrow, I&#39;d get back</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.031" end="01:00:34.631" style="s2">in that truck,</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.531" end="01:00:36.331" style="s2">raise our kids just the same.</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.631" end="01:00:39.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.331" end="01:00:39.431" style="s2">That &#39;s why I want to marry you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.131" end="01:00:46.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, stop making me cry. This makeup</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.231" end="01:00:49.931" style="s2">wasn&#39;t cheap.</p>
<p begin="01:00:46.331" end="01:00:53.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please exchange rings.</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.931" end="01:00:53.031" style="s2">I now</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.331" end="01:01:06.631" style="s2">pronounce you husband and wife. You may</p>
<p begin="01:01:03.631" end="01:01:06.631" style="s2">kiss the bride.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
